maj . gen . mohamed ibrahim , the minister of the interior who was visiting the province of assiut , rejected the expression " purification of the ministry of the interior , " which was circulated in the media . he also pointed out that the police force is one of the national institutions that performs its duty in the best manner under the circumstances prevailing in our country .
the minister of the interior added that having a beard is a habit , not an act of sunnah , and that he has a fatwa to this effect emphasizing that he will punish officers who grow beards by referring them to a disciplinary panel , as he was not convinced by the advice . he also pointed out that general appearance is the most important quality required by the police academy , and that all officers know it , but some of them had abandoned this idea .
this came as an answer to the question directed to the minister about some of the officers who had started to grow their beards recently .
