in the hearing held on wednesday , the attention of all egyptians was turned to the court , witnessing the trial of deposed president hosni mubarak , his two sons , his interior minister , habib al-adili , and six of his aides , who are accused of killing demonstrators and wasting public money .
everyone waited and hoped that the hearing would be decisive in passing a verdict to make the curtain come down on a dark era of egypt 's modern history ,
but the hearing was a final round for various events experienced by the court since the announcement of the referral of the deposed president and his two sons to the prosecution , and until the end of the defense hearings , with respect to both the victims and defendants in the case of the century .
but the egyptian laymen are confused and skeptical about the seriousness of the trial or the ability to pass a final judgment sentencing the former president and al-adili to death for their alleged responsibility for the killing of demonstrators . in addition , many factions refuse to humiliate mubarak and deny his responsibility for the murder or corruption .
this fear and anticipation comes in the absence of the ability of parliament to make any decision to transfer the deposed president to the tora hospital under the pretext that it 's not ready to receive him , and due to the approval of parliament mps , saying that delaying such transfer is based on a " political decision " !
do you believe that the trial of mubarak is really serious and that the conviction of mubarak is definitely coming ? do you expect a death penalty for mubarak and al-adili , as demanded by the prosecution , or that the punishment will be mitigated for mubarak due to his " old age , " with al-adili being the scapegoat ?
will the people give up demanding retaliation ? will we soon see gamal and ala wearing the prison blue suit , or have the acts of the play not come to an end because the author still has a lot of surprises at the end of the show , telling the audience of the people of egypt " with mubarak 's trial , you will never be able to close your eyes " ?
there are many questions . express your opinion and post comments on the end of the deposed president and his aides in the trial of the century .
