on the first day , the elephant tried to undo his chains ; his feet hurt a lot . on the second and third day he attempted it again and again . the owner of the park was certain that if the elephant kept trying , he would undo the chains , but if it despaired , he would give up .
that had already happened . the elephant gave up and the owner of the park started to have the elephant appear before the public , but he replaced the iron chains with other wooden ones without the elephant noticing , so as not to injure his feet .
one day , one of the visitors of the park noticed that the elephant was tied with wooden chains and asked the park owner why that huge elephant hadn 't broken the chains . the owner of the park answered that the elephant could break the chains , and release himself . the visitor was astonished and said to the owner of the park , " then you must be a fool . " the man answered that the elephant was stupid because he thought that his feet were still tied with the iron chains , even though they were tied with wooden chains , which he could break with one blow .
the second question is : in what way are we similar to the elephant ?
i know that the title may be shocking , but unfortunately that is the truth which has continued to haunt us with its ugly face for more than thirty years , and represents the history of usaid to egypt . in order to talk in an orderly manner , let 's just make this simple calculation together :
the annual amount of usaid to egypt = $ 1 , 300 , 00 , 00 ( one billion , three hundred million dollars ) , which is equivalent to 7 , 800 , 00 , 00 ( seven billion , eight hundred million pounds ) . assuming that the number of adults in egypt is 40 million ( forty million egyptians ) , the annual share per capita ( so to speak ) equals to $ 7 , 800 , 00 , 00 / 40 million people which comes to 195 pounds per year .
so the monthly share per capita is 16 . 25 .
thus , the daily share comes to 54 piasters !
fifty-four piasters is the price for which we sold our dignity and pride , generation after generation . fifty- four piasters is the price for our arab nationalism for decades . fifty-four piasters is the value of the instrument by which the united states came to control our destinies . fifty-four piasters is . .
fifty-four piasters which the former regime made us believe was as a mountain . by the way , this is the first time i have made this calculation , after reading about the initiative launched by his eminence , sheikh mohammed hassan , to dispense with usaid .
in order to avoid talking about the past and its problems , and to keep up with the era of speed , here is a simple question :
can every egyptian citizen save only 54 piasters a day and then [ be able to ] raise his head for the rest of his life ?
there is a story about an elephant which was caught by hunters , who [ then ] sold it to the park . the owner of the park attached huge iron chains to the elephant in order to prevent it from running away from the park .
nothing was given to the people .
allah is our helper , and america is doomed to fall .
may allah grant us dignity and make us dispense with their aid , but the campaign must be sponsored by us in all governorates of egypt , and i 'm sure all people will participate , but we don 't know the account number .
the people were quite negative .
when the revolutionaries appeared and freed our country from the oppression which had lasted for thirty years , the army welcomed their action and announced that a special fund for martyrs and injured people would be created , because they sacrificed for our country and gave a military salute .
later they said that the revolutionaries were traitors and were implementing external agendas .
do you know what the problem is with our country ?
neither oppression , nor hosni , nor the army .
it 's just one thing : ignorance .
at the time when revolutionaries sacrificed their lives and eyes , some people attacked them and others demanded the return of the previous government and endorsed it .
ignorance is a disaster .
all this humility in return for 54 piasters !
how pitiful ? one of us would spend about 540 pounds on snacks and trivial things .
all this humilitation in return for this trivial amount . by allah , if we pay one pound each , we will collect much more . that 's enough ! egypt is superior to all .
