why do we tend to waste our time refuting every single utterance made by other people ,
that is on the one hand . on the other , i cannot really understand what hassn 's qualifications are in order for him to be a preacher , let alone getting him involved in politics and then economics ! he is a graduate of a radio institute , then he joined the open university and earned a degree in communication . then he became a preacher .
then he became a political theoretician who accused workers on strike that they are causing chaos , giving his religious opinion , which challenged the ruler 's authority and is unlawful . he called on revolutionaries to go back to their homes , to give " his highness the president " another opportunity . he even told millions of viewers on satellite tv that he used to cooperate with state security ,
since the interests of religion intersect with those of state security . he falsely accused demonstrators sitting in front of tv headquarters of attacking egyptian army soldiers . he caused conflict when he accused , on arafat mountain during a pilgrimage , all those who opposed the scaf of being traitors . when he went to atfeh , supposedly to contain the strife between muslims and copts , he made statements that copts are using magic against muslims . he is continuously issuing religious opinions about political matters : this demonstration is unlawful , this sit-in is unlawful , that lamp is unlawful , etc . !
if you wonder why this hassan is acting like this , you come under attack from his dervishes and fans . interestingly enough , all sheikh hassan 's fans , without exception , are fond of gossip , void of logic , and lack religion , etiquette , knowledge and good manners . we used to be dissatisfied with amr khaled . alas ! at least his sons are well-behaved .
" kind words and forgiving faults are better than charity followed by injury . "
however , necessity knows no law , and now i have to inflict " injury " on those whom i used to help . i have a little message for the muslim brotherhood and the salafists .
half of the members of this parliament , who acted furiously for the sake of hassan , were in prisons . where was hassan when al-dostor al-asly was accused by the regime of being funded by the muslim brotherhood and islamic groups , because it devoted its writings to defend them ?
where was hassan when no one agreed to represent those accused in the taba bombings , even for exorbitant fees , and hesham mubarak 's centre , run by alaa abdelfattah 's father , ahmed seif al-islam , whom you are branding as an atheist and gay , volunteered to represent them ? where was hassan when human rights centers , the april 6 th movement , and socialist revolutionaries used to take to the streets , chased by the police , in order to draw attention to your sufferings ?
where was hassan when i , your humble servant , used to follow-up on your cause and run from wadi al-natron prison to al-aqrab prison to the lazoghly cells trying to arouse sympathy for your suffering ? they used to call me a terrorist , a member of the muslim brotherhood , and a show-off muslim .
where was hassan when ibrahim eissa used to write about khairat al-shater , abood al-zomor , and tareq el-zomar day after day ? i will tell you where he was . he was conducting the funeral of al-salab . he was leading the prayer with zakareya azmy , fathy srour and safwat al-sherif . it did not occur to him to tell that gang after prayers that they should fear god and release the men being kept in prison for no reason .
does sheikh hassan want to find resources to replace the aid money or want to drive me crazy ? if he wanted to drive me crazy , he can rest assured since i have already gone mad . if his goal was to find alternative resources to replace us aid , there are endless ways to secure money equal to us aid , and more . some examples , to name just few , are to :
god arranged for your release . how come you consider those guys i mentioned above , who supported you , defended you , and suffered for doing so , as unbelievers , atheists , gays , shi 'a followers , masons , and v for vendetta ? how come you consider al-rowiny , who approved the military verdicts against you , as your ally ; yesterday 's terrorists fighters for the prestige of the ministry of the interior ; and the guy who used to collect money in the name of religion , while you were brutally tortured in prisons , as your sheikh ?
reconsider all agreements and treaties for exporting oil , gas , and metals that egypt has concluded ;
you are acting like a jew ! you have surpassed all examples of meanness !
this is her opinion about sheikh mohamed hassan 's initiative .
we want reasonable discussion
with constructive comments , dear members .
2 - reconsider all agreements with multinational companies .
3 - suez canal revenues , where do they go ?
4 - reconsider distribution of state resources and the budget .
