moreover , the people 's assembly should consider the property of the rich , set a minimum and a maximum level for wages and for a standard of living . as far us aid , except for the tiniest crumbs , it goes to the army ,
which owns enterprises that enable it to offer aid to the us . the weapons that the army buys are used only against demonstrators . a case in point is the incident of 6 egyptian soldiers who were killed at the border , but the egyptian army did not bat an eye , whereas its soldiers are quick to shoot live ammunition as soon as they see demonstrators .
this means that we staged a revolution that improved the army 's conditions ; saved the transfer of power to mubarak 's son and the first lady 's haughtiness , gamal mubarak 's sharp tongue ; elevated its council to a position that it had never dreamt of ; and made it control the whole national economy instead of just 18 % . in return for all this the army beats us , tortures us , tears our clothes off , kills us , inflicts defamation on us , frames convictions on us , lets the soldiers urinate on us ! so , shall we raise funds for them ?
