wall photos
yesterday we posted an important warning about a code that we detected on the april 6 th page . we were not sure what it refers to , but today we deciphered it .
this site issues instructions and establishes targets by posting photos .
once , the site posted a photo of a book-burning and removed it within hours . two days later , the egyptian scientific institute was set on fire .
when the site posted a photo of a fan killing another fan , the port said massacre took place .
guess what the site posted today ? photos for the underground !
relate this with the following .
in the name of god the most gracious , the most merciful .
the photo was posted on the april 6 th page with a caption that reads " oh , you who live under the ground rise up ; those living on the earth have passed away ! "
an accurate map for all underground lines was posted to the we are all khaled said page .
the warning issued by israel to all its citizens is to leave egypt as urgently as possible .
the inauguration of the third underground line is scheduled for tomorrow .
these include a photo of a man wearing a vendetta mask , photos of the underground , and photos explaining how to make grenades and fireballs .
it is pretty clear now that the target is the underground .
oh god , make my guesses turn out to be wrong ; oh my god , make my guesses turn out to be wrong , oh my god , make my guesses turn out to be wrong !
we will post the photos consecutively as they appear on the site . follow us for more .
may god save us and egypt .
