an important warning to the youth at nasr city :
to the youth in nasr city , beware of fake tv interviews .
the deceitful broadcaster presents financial gifts to the victims to entrap them and steal their body organs .
the al-masaa weekly newspaper learned that there are about five victims who were killed by criminals and outlaws who are traders of human organs .
they entrap young people through a fake tv interview held with them in the streets by using a minibus bearing the logo of a fake tv channel ,
and they have a well-dressed broadcaster carrying 200 dollars to offer it as a prize to the young man or woman after answering some easy questions .
then the fake tv team lures the victim to get into the car after getting the prize , and drugs him or her , in order to steal his / her body organs , such as the cornea and the kidney ; this has spread panic among the youth of nasr city and the 6 th of october .
