2 - a president who is not an extremist . this means that he would be governing in accordance with islamic law , as islam is a religion of moderation .
3 - as having an absolute consensus , this is impossible . people do have different views with regard to god .
but he should endeavor to act right and establish justice . this is the requirement , as there is always good and evil .
if he is good , the evil people , like thugs or those with interests , who prioritize over the right , over egypt and over justice , will not be satisfied .
but we are concerned with the good people . 4 -
