what does civil disobedience mean ?
it means that if you work in the government , at the end of the month , they will tell you that there are no salaries , because the citizens are in a state of civil disobedience and don 't pay taxes and bills , so the government has no revenues .
* it means that the water company , the electric company and the telecommunications company can stop their services because you do not pay the bills .
* it means that if you work in the private sector and you 're required to go to work , you will not find any means of transportation .
* it means that if you work on a daily basis , you will not be able to get to your job and will not get any income or buy food for your family .
* it means that if you do not have money , you will not be able to withdraw money from the bank because it is closed .
* it means inflation and doubling commodity prices while people are already suffering a great deal .
* it means destroying our economy and the government resorting to obtaining loans from the world bank controlled by the jews , and accepting its conditions , topped by the removal of subsidies on flour and gasoline .
* this means that the price of one liter of gasoline will be 9 - 12 pounds and a loaf of bread will be 2 pounds like in the rest of the countries of the world .
