i have a question for people who were once university students ,
or to those who just pass by universities :
is the university a place where students collect knowledge ,
or do students even attend lectures regularly ?
if anyone answers affirmatively , i 'll respond by saying that only a few of them do ,
while the majority just go there to walk in the corridors and sit in the sunny parks .
by the end of the year , they just collect summaries and sheets of all of the subjects and memorize them ; then they write what they memorized in the exam paper to pass the exams .
so , they support civil disobedience because it will be in their interest , because they hope that it will cause the professors to delete large parts of the subjects .
let anyone who wants to evaluate the topic as bad do so ,
but you should understand that egypt 's interests will never be achieved through the ideas of reckless groups of people .
peace be upon you !
i know that some people may insult me and evaluate the topic as bad , but i just want to express my feelings .
