it emerged on april 6 , 2008 when a group of young people , who didn 't have any political or partisan affiliations , but included many religious youth , called for supporting the strike declared by workers in mahallah , and called for this on the internet .
they said that they would participate in the strike in april , and anyone who had to leave his home could wear black clothes to show his / her rejection of oppression on behalf of poor workers , as well as against corruption and stealing egypt .
on that day , i had to travel , so i wore black clothes .
the streets in alexandria were empty .
i saw many people wearing black clothes , including a salafist man .
