i 'll tell you a story about something that happened to me today .
my husband told me the same thing , but i told him that it was very difficult . however , he said to me , " allah is great and able to do anything . "
i wanted to buy some items to prepare 10 -minute dough , but i didn 't have enough money . today we were going past the shop , which had a sale . he told me to go and buy what we needed up to a total of 70 riyals .
we went and bought ( a rolling pin for 11 riyals , a pizza cutter for 7 riyals , egg brushes for 9 riyals , cutters with different forms for 5 riyals , fried food tongs for 9 riyals , a large tray for 19 riyals ) , ( a sieve for 11 riyals , sweets for 8 riyals , vaseline for 2 riyals , tongs for 2 riyals , perfume for 7 riyals , and coal tongs for 5 riyals ) . i may have forgotten some items .
after i finished , my husband asked me whether i checked the name of the country where the items were made . i answered negatively . he told me that it was up to me , but i said to him that i would check and wouldn 't take any chinese items . he told me to take only the necessary items , but i refused . he said to me that allah made us go there to test us .
praise be to allah ! i returned all the items , which i had neded badly for more than a month , namely those between the first two brackets , while the second group were not chinese . then i told him that we would take the items to the cashier and tell him .
my husband was clever in conveying the message . he told the man that we would take some of the items , but not the rest because i was boycotting chinese products . the man was surprised and didn 't understand , but my husband told him that i was responding to el-qaradawi 's fatwa and that he had told me that it would be easier to stop using water ( liar ! ) .
the man told him that we wouldn 't find anything to buy then , and that no one had done that before . my husband told him that we were the first and many people would do the same thing , because it would be unreasonable to give them a single riyal to use to kill people .
the man said , " may allah reward you with the best ! " when we went home , my husband told me that he would take me to the japanese shop to reward me , even though he used to hate it because i used to spend a lot of time shopping there . at that time , i felt that i was being rewarded by allah .
sorry for being too lengthy . but if you can 't do it yourself , you may tell the people you know so that you may be rewarded .
in the name of allah !
i forgot to tell you that when we went home , my husband asked me about the countries where the items we bought were made . i told him that the picker was korean , the coal holder was japanese , the sieve was syrian , and the rest of items were made in saudi arabia . he was surprised that the sieve was syrian .
how come ? we are boycotting because of them . are you crazy ? i told him that i was happy because it was an arab product and i hadn 't noticed that . he said to me , " i have told you many times not to use your mind , please . " that was the end of the story . i know that i have been too lengthy .
