i remember when they organized demonstrations to dismiss shafiq and handed a list of names to the scaf to choose one as the prime minister , and it chose sharaf .
later , they said sharaf was not suitable for that stage and demanded the scaf dismiss him .
i also remember when they said that the muslim brotherhood stole the revolution .
then they suggested handing over power to el-katani , the speaker of the parliament , even though the majority belonged to the muslim brotherhood .
i remember when the scaf saluted the martyrs of the revolution , then killed more martyrs at maspero and the cabinet , and allowed the police to kill them at mohamed mahmoud .
i remember when the scaf praised the revolutionaries and then accused them of treachery .
i also remember when the scaf announced that we had to adhere to the results of the referendum but it didn 't do that , and it announced that the constitution would be written before the presidential elections .
there are many corrupt people in our country , including young people and the elders .
after all that , we can see that we are all corrupt in a sense ; even if we are not corrupt in the financial and moral sense , we are so in the intellectual sense .
corruption is prevalent among us - when we demand anything , we don 't think of its consequences , only to change our minds soon after .
it 's bad that one makes a mistake , but it 's even worse that one insists on making it .
unfortunately , we do this because we demand something , but soon after we change our minds .
we still can 't decide on what we want .
