the secretary of the fatwa committee in aswan , mamdouh ismail , is like the man who urinated at zamzam !
the secretary of the fatwa committee in aswan , sheikh habib mansour , likened salafist mp mamdouh ismail , who made the adhan during the parliament session held on tuesday , to a person who tried to urinate in the well of zamzam .
mansour explained that metaphor in a fatwa issued by saying : there was a man looking for fame and he went , so he urinated in the well of zamzam , and when the people tried to stop him and beat him , he said to them , " i want my name to be mentioned , even if it 's by cursing me . " he added : " what mamdouh ismail did in the parliament is similar to what this man did , in that they both want to be mentioned , even if the way is different . "
mansour continued : while the state is burning and the interior ministry is suffering because of the bloody confrontations , and the community needs to stop violence and take action quickly and decisively , we find an mp making the adhan in the parliament at such a time and in such a way . this indicates one thing only - namely , that this person is unaware of the jurisprudence of reality and priorities .
the secretary of the al-azhar fatwa committee in aswan reminded mp mamdouh ismail of what the prophet , peace be upon him , did during the early days of the islamic call , as he used to pray in the kaaba while there were idols around him , but he did not ask anyone to destroy them .
when islam became stronger and the prophet and his companions returned to mecca , he ordered that all idols be demolished .
he commented : " this is the jurisprudence of reality that ismail and others don 't know . "
mansour continued , saying : " concerning the jurisprudence of priorities , what he did reminds me of a pious man who wanted to give advice to a man who was drinking wine and who was accompanied by a woman with whom he wanted to commit adultery . instead of ordering him to give up what he was doing , he went to him and said : " oh so-and-so , why don 't you grow your beard and adhere to the guidance of the prophet , peace be upon him ? " he added : " both are equally ignorant of the jurisprudence of priorities . "
mansour concluded his fatwa by directing his talk to mamdouh ismail , saying : " if you want to make the adhan , i promise i 'll find you a job in the ministry of awqaf to make the adhan at the top of your voice , but leave the parliament to those who solve the people 's problems and draft laws . "
