it means that if you work in the government , at the end of the month , they will tell you that there are no salaries , because the citizens are in a state of civil disobedience and don 't pay taxes and bills , so the government has no revenues .
* it means that the water company , the electricity company and the telecommunications company can stop their services because you do not pay the bills .
* it means that if you work in the private sector and you 're required to go to work , you will not find any public transportation .
