the ones who can identify them are the policemen , because they already know the slums and the people in areas where thugs live . however , security in port said was and is still very bad , and before the recent events , abduction and theft prevailed in port said . in addition , people 's comments make me feel that port said is only concerned about football .
i knew about the match by chance ; i was talking to my friend on the phone , and she told me that there was a match and that her fiance wanted to go to the stadium and he was an ahly fan , even though he lived in port said . so it 's not necessarily true that all port said citizens are fans of their team .
i know another girl whose brother received a blow to his back with a sword , and he returned home with blood dripping from him ; this means that the people who were attacking the fans didn 't know who belonged where .
