and i 'm rarely influenced by rumors .
and since the first day of the revolution , i haven 't feared for egypt with respect to all the dangers threatening its safety ,
because i had seen more than this and had witnessed all egypt 's wars and disasters .
i only feared for the people in the square , who were sleeping under the tanks in the severe cold and under the snipers ' shooting to buy freedom and social justice with their blood .
so what made me panic ?
i read some things written by a number of members , whom i think are scorpions living among us ,
in which they instigated egyptians to kill one another , as if arousing a civil war .
one of those scorpions demanded that the salafists not remain silence with respect to those who ridicule and belittle them and that they should kill them before the latter kill the salafists .
i sent this sentence to the administration .
i hope that no one will say that it was just because of her anger .
peace be upon you all !
this instigation was repeated about ten times to convince the salafists to show their strength to those opposing them .
in addition , since last week , there has been much talk on facebook about the muslim brotherhood 's militias , which will appear when necessity arises .
and the youth considered that the clashes between them and the muslim brotherhood 's youth were the beginning of the appearance of such militias and that they would fight back by shooting at the muslim brotherhood , particularly after the port said disaster and the subsequent calls .
they fooled us by shouting the slogan , " peaceful , " therefore we will be fools if the state security soldiers or police officers kill us or gouge our eyes out and we just remain silent ; we should fight back in the same manner ,
and attack the tora prison and kill gamal and sawfwat with our hands .
those two really deserve to be killed , but through law , not with our hands .
so the salafists ' call didn 't work .
then instigating the muslim brotherhood to get involved in clashes didn 't work either .
and the port said disaster wasn 't completed .
so they started to make more explicit calls for clashes between the opposing groups , between the revolutionaries and the police , between the revolutionaries and the army , etc . ,
oh allah , grant egypt peace !
which means an inevitable civil war .
regardless of the identity of the person who made the call or the owner of the electronic committee , s / he wants to destroy egypt ,
be it omar suleiman , or gamal mubarak and his mother susan ,
or be it the dissolved state security agency and safwat el-sherif 's aides ,
or israel and its well-known secret agents in egypt .
whatever it is , the result will be a disaster that will afflict all egyptians ; and the tora gang will not be prosecuted , and justice will not be established .
at which time , the martyrs ' and the egyptian people 's rights will be lost ,
and egypt will be destroyed for the benefit of the neighboring country and its mother , the ghost country .
beware , dear , and try to spread awareness among other people .
violence never solves any problem in any country - even war doesn 't solve any problems .
