a plan for boycotting chinese and russian products .
the following are the steps for the boycott :
the boycott will be as follows :
- individuals : they should not buy the products of these two countries ( russia , china ) for any purpose , even a pencil .
the owners of small shops ( groceries ) : they should not buy any goods produced by these two countries from wholesalers .
- wholesale shop owners : they should not buy any goods produced by these two countries from importers .
main merchants , importers : they should not buy any goods from these two countries and stop any dealings with them .
main merchants : they should tell the regional directors of these two countries that they are boycotting their products for the sake of the syrian people ,
spreading this culture among all of those who have any dealings with the main merchants in these two countries .
