sheikh hazem abu ismail , the likely candidate for the presidency , postponed the date of his weekly sermon at the asad bin al-furat mosque for 15 minutes because of his keenness to offer condolences to the family of the martyr " omar mohsen . " he was a student at the american university , and was killed in the events of port said , and the consolation tent was pitched in the street opposite the mosque .
abu ismail said in a short speech delivered at the condolence tent , " people who fear death are valueless , " and stressed that the egyptian people should be ready to sacrifice their souls for the sake of change .
abu ismail added : we should live in dignity like these martyrs and protest humiliation and injustice , because if we accept humiliation , death will be better for us . on the other hand , abu ismail announced during the weekly lesson that he was preparing a document consisting of a few items concerning the handover of power to an elected civilian power , to start mobilizing the masses to support this document .
abu ismail charged the various political factions with the responsibility for the mismanagement of the transitional phase , pointing out that some forces do not want to hand over power to the people , and others wanted the scaf to rule for two years .
