in a sudden decision , the al-hayah tv network has announced it is boycotting the coverage of the mohamed mahmoud street events , and removed its cameras . it also announced that it is stopping the broadcast of the events taking place around the ministry of the interior on air in its news shows which have been covering them live since the events began , following the massacre in port said stadium .
ahmed al-khatib , editor-in-chief of the al-haya now news program , who is responsible for live coverage for the tv network , stated : the management of al-hayah tv has decided to resume its normal program , with the schedule beginning tomorrow , saturday , and will boycot the coverage of the mohamed mahmoud events , except in its regularly scheduled broadcast news programs ,
based on the network 's sense of responsibility towards the community , by refraining from participating in the events .
