what the hell are you doing ? are you protecting them from the people ? is the price of this protection worth the people 's hostility against you ? is there anything in the world that 's worth losing people over ?
what do you want from us ? yes , i mean you , the generals of the scaf ? what exactly do you want from egyptians ?
i 'm a simple citizen who has always stated my respect for the scaf and defended it against anyone who insulted or offended it .
i also endured insults , offenses and accusations leveled against me as if i were a secret agent of the scaf .
i wonder , like millions of people , " how will this situation end ? "
the problem is that we called your attention thousands of times , not because we are smart and witty , but
we called your attention that your plans to spread chaos and frighten people were old-fashioned and exposed .
some people may even demand that you use new plans so that the people may be deceived by them .
why didn 't you given priority to the people 's interests from the beginning : wouldn 't it have been much easier , safer , and more noble ?
we are fed up with your plots , plans , and schemes .
who is hosni mubarak ? who is safwat el-sherif ? and who is ezz ? what 's the importance of those people compared with the future and safety of the egyptian people ?
starting with the battle of the camel , we were tied to a waterwheel , like a bull with a blindfold on our eyes , and we were left to revolve big question marks which confused us , and we almost lost all our believes in our country .
from the time the prisons were opened and the criminals released , to the farce of breaking into the state security building , and burning the churches , and authorizing some people who don 't have any capacity to control the crowds , as if you yourselves don 't have any capacity or power .
in addition , those people couldn 't pacify or control the crowds because this was arranged together with them , and the evidence was that the road was cut off and the strikes didn 't stop .
during that time , unprecedented organized waves of criminal activity took place , which didn 't reflect the behavior of the egyptian people , resulting in a number of abduction incidents during which the ministry of interior showed its power but soon relapsed into its previous state .
there were also many military trials of civilians , particularly the revolutionaries , some of whom disappeared for months without their families knowing where they were imprisoned , in addition to the problems of martyrs , whose numbers only increased .
since the breakfast feast , when tahrir square was evacuated , to date , all crimes committed at the square , [ by ] mohamed mahmoud and the cabinet , who assassinated certain revolutionaries and released a large number of trained thugs to appear and burn facilities , and organized a campaign to make people hate the revolution and its youth , prove that your actions have been shameful and farcical !
this also includes the ridiculous referendum which cost the state billions , in addition to the useless constitutional amendments and the race for parliamentary elections , all of which you handled like a game , while you had your own plans .
even after the agreements ander aft sucessfuly dividing the cake , suspicious matters emerged , such as signing the presidential election law without first announcing it , just four days before the first session of parliament . the people then wondered if there was any disagreement .
when a good minister of the interior appeared , he was sacrificed in the name of a false state of lawlessness , because this coincided with the demands of handing over power .
what about the uniform which criminals wore during the crimes of armed robbery ?
why is this group given the same weight as the entire country ?
all of them wore garments , jackets and put scarves over their faces like arabians did .
who prepared such idiotic plans ?
finally , there was the port said catastrophe which reflects intentional negligence and betrayal .
it happened on thursday night while i was writing my article , and with my heart bleeding . finally , i say ,
only allah knows what will happen tomorrow , 73 deaths and 1 , 00 injured people ? a master stroke . an atmosphere that cherishes a history of enmity between al-ahly and el-masry , and one more battle to add to our history of catastrophes .
all this for the sake of the ousted idiot who destroyed our country in thirty days with the help of his aides .
is this the regard you hold for the people in your eyes , gentlemen ? your children , grandchildren and relatives belong to the people . what 's the goal ? do you want us to surrender and forgive him for all that happened in the past ?
i think that after all this suffering , you have realized that we will never surrender , because there is a revolution , which you admitted . however , you wasted all this time and employed some people to spread strange ideas and idiotic statements that destroyed our country , because your calculations always fail .
every time you think that we are dead , you find that we are still alive , and we are fed up with your actions .
i hope the message will be conveyed this time .
why does he use a helicopter and why is there a special ambulance at his service while we spend hours waiting for an ambulance ?
allah is sufficient for us and he is the best guardian .
and our martyrs are glorious .
