where is the trial of the battle of the camel ?
what about that lady who employed a group of people , whose loyalty she guarantees through documents , and videos shot in bedrooms , bank transfers and other dirty business which prevailed in our country ?
where is safwat el-sherif ? what about his prosecution ? no news of him .
why was boutros ghali sentenced to thirty-years imprisonment in the car plate number case ; while those who sabotaged our country are still being taken care of and protected like the most honorable people ?
they are sons of . . i just don 't want to say insults ,
