the activists of the famous social networking website " twitter " celebrated the return of media actor tawfiq okasha , who appeared on the el-fara 'een satellite channel after a period of time .
the department of investment disputes within the court of administrative litigation issued a judgment to stop the ( egypt today ) show presented by tawfiq okasha on the el-fara 'een satellite channel , and required both the general authority for investments and the egyptian satellite company " nile sat " to stop broadcasting the el-fara 'een satellite channel signal on the egyptian satellite nilesat broadcast during the show .
okasha defied the judgment and appeared on his show despite the administrative court judgment and another lawsuit that demanded that a judgment be passed ordering the minister of information and the general investment authority to implement the judgment of the administrative court .
tawfiq okasha attacked maj . gen . mamdouh shaheen , assistant defense minister for legal affairs , and charged him with being responsibile for all of the gaps in the electoral law .
the twitter activists expressed their joy at the return of akasha through dozens of tweets that called for watching akasha , as a revolutionary , after his failure in the parliamentary elections .
