sheikh hazem abou ismail , the potential candidate for the presidency of the republic , described the suggestion which called for the people 's assembly to elect an interim president for the republic as a prelude for " setting the whole country on fire " .
in statements of his on his personal account on facebook , " abou ismail " renewed his call to elect the president directly by the people , then dissolve the people 's assembly and re-elect the parliament afresh .
the potential candidate said , in another statement on his page , that he " there is absolutely no room for the military council to persist in the authority that exercises pressure using its enormous tools during the laying down of the constitution of the country in any form , as it is a crime of coercion , " adding , " the nation have a right to be completely free , as they lay down the constitution of their country themselves without any authoritative pressure on them . "
he stressed the need for the " military council to leave the political authority by electing a president for the republic back to their military mission without a role in pressuring the constitution . "
he renewed his call to " abolish the shura council , with all the ensuing regulations " , noting that that is an " excellent suggestion to expedite the handing over of power on april 30 th so as to complete the election of the president of the republic . "
