el-youm el-sabea reveals the muslim brotherhood 's plan to sell the national newspapers and maspero .
el-youm el-sabea published in its sunday issue important details on the brotherhood 's plan to sell the national newspapers and maspero , as a front-page report and the details on page five . the report reveals the so-called economic plan of the freedom and justice party , a plan which aims at taking a number of actions against monopolistic practices in all sectors .
on the fourth page of the same issue we can also read a comprehensive coverage of the demonstrations on the anniversary of the revolution , under the title of the qasr el-nile prayer : " oh allah , punish the muslim brotherhood , the traitors ! " and the group replies : " those who are calling for handing over power were asking the " military " to stay . "
