a leading israeli official demands that mubarak 's family refund $ 300 million which were paid to change the egyptian curricula .
a leading israeli official demands that mubarak 's family refund $ 300 million which were granted to change the egyptian curricula .
nablus tv 's website stated that the leading official in the labor party , benjamin ben-eliezer , recently demanded that deposed egyptian president hosni mubarak refund $ 300 million which were paid by the israelis to change the egyptian curricula in order to reduce hostility toward israel .
in the same context , a leading regulatory agency in egypt is conducting investigations concerning what is known as the scandal of changing the curricula , which reported the involvement of suzanne mubarak , wife of the deposed egyptian president . the investigations file includes audio recordings of meetings attended by suzanne mubarak , and israeli experts and specialists in changing the religious education and history curricula , as well as experts in arabic and social psychology , in the presence of the israeli ambassador to egypt , according to the website .
the " rose al-youssef " newspaper stated that suzanne mubarak promised the israelis at the meeting , which was held at the presidential palace in 1998 , to pressure the ministers of education , and endowments as well as the grand mufti of egypt , to work on the implementation of the plan to change the curricula , in response to the israeli desire ,
and emphasized that suzanne mubarak received $ 300 million after two months of talks with the israeli experts and promised to take on herself the task of reprinting the school textbooks , after deleting the quranic verses and hadiths that attacked the jews .
the israeli experts had briefed suzanne mubarak on the reasons that prevented the egyptians from accepting the idea of the normalization of relations with their country , the most important of which were the history and religious education curricula , adopted in the three academic levels .
according to the website , president hosni mubarak himself committed to working to implement the agreement , and recommended having fewer lessons discussing the arab-israeli conflict , and focusing on lessons that discussed the benefits of the peace process . suzanne mubarak also announced her approval of including verses from the torah in the curricula , and shedding light on the era of the jewish presence in egypt .
source : russia today .
