dr . mohamed el-baradei , the former director of the international atomic energy agency ( iaea ) , stated that the egyptian revolution needs a supreme council and spokespersons so as not to diffuse its forces , and called for organizing demonstrations on january 25 th , saying , " i want to see a real crowd on january 25 th , because the revolution will continue and will achieve all its objectives . "
el-baradei witnessed the signing ceremony of a new book by the novelist dr . alaa al-aswani , entitled , " was the egyptian revolution wrong ? " the ceremony was held on monday night at the el-shorouq printing and publishing house , in the presence of george isaac ; wael kandil , managing editor of el-shorouq , dr . mohamed abul-ghar , dr . mona makram ebeid , the engineer hazem abdel-azim , the justice zakaria abdul aziz , samira ibrahim , and khaled said 's mother .
for his part , the founder of the kifaia movement , george isaac , demanded that dr . mohamed el-baradei declare his leadership of the egyptian revolution and the formation of a coaltion broad of all revolutionary forces ,
which el baradei accepted under one condition , namely , that tahrir square would approve this matter first .
the people present at the signing ceremony of al-aswani 's latest book shouted slogans against the scaf , such as " down with military rule , " and confirming their participation in the demonstrations to be held next january 25 th to complete the revolution , one year after it had begun .
