the accomplishments of the highest council for armed forces in the transitional period include :
general commander for the armed forces
doing the first free and transparent elections by the testimony of the egyptian people and the world , -
and securing the vote right for egyptians out of the country in both the parliament and presidential elections .
dissolving the national party and handing in all the headquarters that are related to it to the state , and recovering the money of the national party -
arresting the prisoners who fled during the security chaos-
detention of over 47 state security officers who are violating work-
arresting the spy , elan garbel and replacing him by two egyptian captives-
arresting the spy , elan garayel and replacing him by two egyptian captives-
establishing the board of grievance at the cabinet -
arresting the jordanian spy of communication , bashar abou zaid - and handing him for trial -
completing a deal that the arab leaders failed to complete which is exchanging 1 , 027 palestinian prisoners with the soldier gilad shalit-
sending ships and airplanes to help one hundred thousand egyptians to return from libya -
commander in chief of the armed forces
dissolving forged local councils -
tenure for teachers who have gone through kader test , which is the procedure teachers waited for too long-
increasing the physicians ' salaries -
allocating 21 million square meters for the youth in a development project north east suez canal -
preparing for offering 1 , 850 lots in the city of 6 th of october for family housing by the lot system -
preparing for offering 1 , 850 lots in 6 th of october for family housing by the lot system -
assigning a committee to embrace the returnees from libya to find job opportunities for them -
establishing the first union for farmers in egypt -
closing the outlets for funding the destruction movements in egypt -
first democratic referendum for the people on the road map and full commitment to it -
fair and legal trial for the strongest and largest and most important figure of corruption and force centers in egypt -
air force commander
first official apology to egypt from israel for the first time in its history-
realization of reconciliation between fatah and hamas in hours after it stumbled for long years -
moving abu mazen for unesco and acknowledging the state of palestine for the first time in history -
completing the deal of exchanging prisoners with the israeli soldier shalit after the failure of many countries to intercede with hamas for years that have exceeded five .
inauguration of zewail scientific university -
mine clearance for el alamain desert preparing for planting it with wheat -
enabling the inhabitants of beloved sinai from enlisting and opening all the military colleges before them -
the project for housing the nuba people which had its first stage completed and inaugurated -
injecting a billion gennehs in the country 's budget to cover for the budget deficit -
securing and finishing and accomplishing the most wonderful democratic experience that egypt and the world witnessed in the last elections , by the testimony of the whole world -
navy force commander
refusing to install western military bases in any neighboring arabic country -
