we are the ones to liberate ourselves from military rule as we liberated ourselves from the ousted regime . believe me sister , once we get rid of followers of the ousted regime and eliminate corruption ,
you will see the people 's assembly performing differently and you will see the people themselves with a totally different attitude . we will work happily for our country without fear of any forces that would try to frustrate our efforts .
