when central security forces surrounded us on january 25 at the end of port-said street in alexandria and the attack began , i kept calling on my dear colleague sayed turkey : " have no fear sayed , have no fear sayed , " and i was almost dying of fear ; then i did not see him again .
i leaned against a iron gate belonging to one of the stores as i tried to take my breath away from the gas . out of the intense pressure from terrified demonstrators due to the ferocity of the attack , the " iron " gate fell and i fell on my back inside a small store whose area does not exceed 10 meters .
soon there were scores , perhaps even hundreds dashing into the store to escape the attacks and teargas shells while i was lying on the floor . they were trampling me with their feet without realizing . they could not in any way tell that i and others like me were lying on the floor unable to move .
soon there were tens , perhaps even hundreds dashing into the store to escape the attacks and teargas shells while i was lying on the floor . they were trampling me with their feet without realizing . they could not in any way tell that i and others like me were lying on the floor unable to move .
at that time i felt that my time was near , i smelled the scent of death , the moment that i had feared , and i was so amazed that i received this moment with strange calmness and tranquility . i realized that i will die , but i will die with honor , i will die a death that i have wished , although i was wishing at the time that i would not die beneath the feet .
nonetheless , i did not die . i managed to stand up with the help of a young man whom i do not know , and i managed to escape after receiving a severe beating .
the important thing is that i did not die . i managed to stand up with the help of a young man whom i do not know , and i managed to escape after receiving a severe beating .
when you face death in a certain moment , which then passes by , your fear of death | it decreases a lot and your adherence to the cause for which you exposed yourself to death increase . simply put : you no longer have anything to fear .
on the famous wednesday , the day of the battle of the camel , i woke up in the morning on the sound of a massive demonstration coming from a distance . i rushed to put my clothes on in order to join them , thinking that it was the revolutionaries ' demonstration that i was joining everyday when we would continue our march to the town center .
i went down in hurry and was surprised by a young man in one of the far balconies cursing the ( demonstrators ) and describing them as traitors . i thought he was a supporter of the deposed , but then i was surprised to see that the young man was right and that the whole ( demonstration ) was supporting the deposed . it was raising his pictures and chanting his name .
they were around three hundred persons , they looked strange as usual , but i did not hesitate . i forced myself inside the demonstration and when i became in the center exactly , i started shouting at the top of my voice : " down down hosni mubarak ; revolution revolution until victory , revolution in every street in egypt . "
i did not escape , of course , getting cursed and insulted with the most obscene words , getting pushed by hands and getting kicked ; but i was not afraid at all . i did not feel that i was alone , i rather felt that i was one hundred men , one thousand men , a whole battalion .
i marched with them , while they chanted i chanted , while they spoke i spoke until my voice became louder than their voice , until spectators joined me and we proceeded until we joined the revolutionaries .
you who have kept your distance from the revolution since the beginning - and still do : we were afraid too , but we were loath to let this moment pass without breaking the barrier of fear inside us ! we gave something to our country . we finally acted upon our faith and our principles , we have become men .
the man next to me fell on the day national security fell and was killed on the spot , so i hated death once again , but i will never let fear overcome me once again .
the man next to me fell on the day national security fell and was killed instantly , so i hated death once again , but i will never let fear overcome me once again .
do you know why we are zealous over our revolution ?
