when you see a fight in the microbus and voices are raised , each swearing that he will pay for the other 's ticket-
when you see a housewife saving the empty jars of jam for long years without using them , she is certainly egyptian- .
when we have visitors and they say goodbye because they 're leaving , and then they stand by the door talking for an hour , they 're egyptian to the core-
when you see us keeping bags of all shapes and colors under the mattress , we are egyptians-
when you see a people in the largest crisis that it has gone through . . and it does not forget to laugh and make puns and make those around it laugh , and all the world talks about it and its humor , then you surely mean the greatest people on the globe . . the people of egypt-
if you ask a taxi driver about an address and instead of guiding you he says follow me . . then he is egyptian- .
and , by the way , sometimes he changes his direction because he has a real desire to take you and is afraid you 'll get lost
if you pray somewhere and after prayer , the person beside you extends his hand and says " may god accept " . . then he is egyptian-
if you hear him say , after laughing a lot , " good , may god make it good , " then be sure that he is egyptian- . .
if you call him on the telephone and he says to you for no reason : " many happy returns , " then be sure he is egyptian-
when you meet somebody and you ask him a question and he will never say " i don 't know ! " an egyptian genius-
when you go out and you see somebody leaning on your car and when he sees you he laughs and says " excuse me , pasha- "
if you walk in and he 's eating , even if just bread and onions , he has to say " do me the honor of sharing the food " and he repeats it three or four times-
