the ministry of the interior announced that because of calls issued by some political forces , currents , and coalitions to demonstrate peacefully tomorrow ( friday ) , tahrir square will be evacuated by the police forces beginning at midnight tonight ( thursday ) 8 september until midnight on friday , 9 september
the ministry has asked all participating forces and the honorable youth of the revolution not to allow the entrance or infiltration of any elements attempting to exploit these legitimate peaceful gatherings to conduct any operations , attempt to break the law , or to cause chaos , riots , or attacks against any public or private property , or to hinder traffic and the business of citizens .
the ministry stressed that it is performing its duties to protect police facilities and sites as they are the property of the people , and that it will firmly confront all attempts to attack them , and that the security of egypt is the responsibility of all honorable egyptians .
