release of asmaa mahfouz on bail of 20 thousand pounds
click to enlarge
asmaa mahfouz
military prosecutors have decided to release activist asmaa mahfouz on bail of 20 thousand pounds with an ongoing investigation of the case . a military source has said that if the bail isn 't paid , she will be imprisoned .
the military tribunal summoned the activist asmaa mahfouz in order to hear her statement regarding the charges given against her , including " attacking the military council by publishing materials on her page on the social networking website " facebook and twitter , " and directing curses and insults at the military council and its members
the tribunal summoned her in order to listen to her statement and to examine what she published on her " facebook " page urging attempts at assassinations and cursing the military council , and to learn her reasons for writing this .
the activist asmaa mahfouz had said on the facebook website on her main page directly , " if our judiciary does not restore our rights , nobody should be upset if armed groups come out and commit a series of assassinations , and as long as there is no law and there is no judiciary , nobody should be upset by anything "
she also directed curses and insults directly at the military council and its members , in addition to what she discussed on the el-nas channel last july 23 .
