you should include the source in order to avoid having the topic closed , dear .
the sources said that she had breakfast with alaa and gamal , just hours before their appearance before the court in the second trial sessions along with their father , the deposed president , [ which took place ] in the police academy in the fifth settlement .
the sources added that their realities in prison did not change after the transfer of the former director of the farm prison , colonel ahmed abdel razek , and his deputy lt . colonel ayman el-masry and lt . colonel mahmoud nafi , the warden supervisor from the former regime icons , because they were allowed to hold 5 star breakfast feasts , spend the time between night prayer and dawn prayer outside their cells , and to sign contracts for the sale and purchase of their property in his office .
the sources pointed out that there were other irregularities in susan thabit 's visit .
the visit took place in the director 's office at 4 : 15 pm , and she was treated as the wife of the president of the republic , and not as a citizen visiting a prisoner .
the first irregularity was allowing her to enter the prison with her car , which is a serious breach of prison rules and regulations .
it was stated that the bar association 's freedoms committee 's delegations and members of some human rights organizations , and the civil society organization , had obtained permission from the attorney general to visit the prison but were not allowed to enter with their cars ; instead they were conducted in a car belonging to the prison sector .
while everyone was looking forward to breakfast last " sunday " , a black car belonging to the republican guard followed by a procession of police cars raced against time to get to tura prison .
the car gave the impression that an important figure was trying to get somewhere on time for breakfast .
it was a surprise . susan mubarak was going to visit her sons , gamal and alaa , in tora prison .
it was the first visit of its kind since alaa and gamal were imprisoned , and we have many details of that visit .
susan was accompanied by both heidi and her son omar and khadija el-gamal .
that visit lasted more than 3 hours , and took place outside official visiting hours ,
but the records in the prison sector showed that it was carried out with the approval of justice dr . abdel meguid mahmoud , the attorney general ,
and that it took place between 2 : 30 pm and 6 : 00 pm , although prison rules ban the opening of any prison after closing time , i . e . , 5 : 00 pm .
according to sources , susan , heidi and khadija stayed inside the prison until the sunset prayer .
