their goal was to occupy the vacant offices .
the revolutionaries continued with their sit-in and some of them decided to unite forces with the scaf .
unidentified people instigated the fury of the people of abbasia through rumors , so they formed grassroots committees and were surprised when a peaceful march confronted them , but there were thugs there who were beating the revolutionaries .
the following day , each party realized its mistake and everyone returned to tahrir and the people of abbasia organized a march to offer their apology .
thus , the islamic trend found itself outside the circle of events , which it didn 't want , so it called for demonstrations on friday , july 29 th , after agreeing with all the other forces that it would be a friday of unity and a time to eliminate disagreements among the various political forces , which was a natural and normal occurrence .
