the july revolution depended on secrecy in its ideas and its coup against the king . the youth revolution was announced and the time and place were specified .
the july revolution was carried out by officers belonging to poor families who hate the rich . the youth revolution was conducted by youth belonging to rich families who feel pain for egypt .
the july revolution was launched in an age in which two equal powers were in control , namely the soviet union and the united states , and it was within the soviet union 's orbit . the youth revolution was launched in an age when one power was in control , which is the united states , supported by the states of western europe and the fox that is israel , and , god willing , it will orbit the entire world for the benefit of egypt .
that was my hope
a greeting to our great army that carried out the july revolution
