aboul-bukhary said to " al-masry al-youm " that " among the demonstrators in tahrir square are salafist youth and youth from the muslim brotherhood , and that they have had tents inside the square since the first day of the sit-in " that began on 8 july .
he added : " i am among the tahrir demonstrators , and i reject everything that abdel-maged has said . "
he continued : " assem 's statements reflect his opinion only and not the islamic current , for we are not against the demonstrators . and it is not true that we are seeking to expel them from the square on the day of the islamists ' demonstration , next friday . "
