the coalition of the youth of the revolution in the city of sharm el-sheikh has decided to carry out the first popular trial of former president hosni mubarak next friday in front of the sharm el-sheikh hospital square ,
the court will be headed by a fair and just judiciary body , and then the ruling will be left after that for the people to implement the popular decision regarding mubarak ,
this step comes in response to the slowness of mubarak 's trial .
mahmoud abdul-haleem , a member of the coalition of the youth of the revolution of january 25 th in sharm el-sheikh , said that next friday , which will be the " popular trial of mubarak friday " in front of the sharm el-sheikh hospital square , will be critical ,
and that a meeting had been held between members of the coalition 's executive office ,
and that a decision had been issued to step up the response to the slowness in trying the former president in the form of a big popular trial of mubarak in the presence of a popular court body , which includes judge mahmoud el-khodairy , mohamed anwar al-sadat , and ambassador ibrahim yusri .
