hassan sobhy hessein , 28 years old , a tuktuk driver in al omraneyah . as he was taking a wrong direction , a traffic policeman called eissa rashed stopped him and raises the tuktuk with the winch of the traffic van . after the driver begged to leave him go .
as the tuktuk driver was asked to pay 200 pounds to let him take the tuktuk and go , he called his brother mohmoud subhy hessein to come and bring 200 pounds with him and the tuktuk authentication papers
the man came and begged the officer to reduce the sum because it was big , and the officer said to him : are you his lawyer , you son of a bitch ? mahmoud told the officer : your mother is not better than my mother and answered him back . therefore , the officer showered him with a hail of insults and said to him : if you do not leave , i will shoot you
the man came and begged the officer to reduce the sum because it was big , and the officer said to him : are you his lawyer , you son of a . . ed woman ? mahmoud told the officer : your mother is not better than my mother and answered him back . therefore , the officer showered him with a hail of insults and said to him : if you do not leave , i will shoot you
mahmoud said to him : you are lying and you do not have the right to do so . .
therefore , the officer drew his police gun and threatened mahmoud who refused to go without the tuktuk , his source of living , and insisted on his request . a verbal quarrel occurred between him and the office who shot two bullets at him , one at his stomach and the other at the top of his right thigh . the people carried him and went to the omm al masriyyeen hospital . .
a detective officer from al omraneyah department came and said that he wanted witnesses to the incident so that he would record the minutes
two witnesses along with the brother of the victim went with him . he told them that the officer was mistaken , therefore , they beat him in the department and threw him in custody . they filed a case of assaulting the authorities and brought other witnesses to testify to the story of the detective . the prosecution decided to imprison them for 4 days pending investigation . after that , they were imprisoned for another 15 days . the detective department insisted on transferring mahmoud from the hospital to the prison hospital but his condition did not allow that , so they handcuffed him to the bed
