our demands : 1 . putting mubarak on trial for high treason based on the confession of the field marshal that mubarak gave orders to the armed forces to kill demonstrators
2 . legal and right based supervision of the national security system and putting on trial all the officers who were involved in killing and torturing the demonstrators
3 . dissolving the central security system or integrating it into the army
4 . dismissing yahya al gamal and putting omar suleiman on trial
5 . setting a minimum and maximum wage limit and redistribution of resources to save the country from the economic crisis and price control
6 . imposing a progressive tax
7 . putting all the corrupt businessmen on trial and confiscating their money
8 . cancelling the referral of civilians to military justice
9 . retrying all those who were sentenced with military judgments after moving them to civilian courts
