the decision of suzan thabet , wife of the former president hosni mubarak , to relinquish all her property to the state aroused an occasion for controversy in tora prison especially between her two sons gamal and alaa , who are in custody pending investigation .
informed sources inside the prison confirmed that as soon as " suzan " declared that she relinquished her wealth and was released , both alaa and gamal met to discuss the matter - in a manner that was heard by all those in prison .
gamal supported his mother 's act to avoid being exposed to imprisonment or any pressures during investigations which could threaten her health .
alluding to the health difficulties that his father is experiencing , gamal demanded that he also do the same .
but alaa objected to gamal 's words clarifying that his mother 's decision to relinquish will proof the charge against her and that this matter won 't change anything .
he said that he is sure that his father won 't venture to take this step .
the sources said that gamal and alaa agreed that they aren 't considering relinquishing their wealth .
in the same context , the sources confirmed that ahmed ezz - imprisoned in tora prison - said to those surrounding him in prison that he 's thinking of taking the same step that the former president 's wife took . after zakaria azmi 's decision of release , he retreated from taking this step clarifying that he 'll be acquitted also .
