then , sorour entered one of the lounges in the illicit profiteering authority , and with him entered his family and a number of his supporters who rallied around him and offered him congratulations , waiting for counselor el-sabrout 's decision of accepting his request or denying it .
sorour had presented to the committee of experts at the illicit profiteering authority several documents portfolios which contained only what he owned and denied what had come in the investigations about his ownership of several assets , villas , and chalets ,
and he attached to these documents a request for release on any guarantee that the committee of experts sees , who presented those documents to counselor assem al-gohari , president of the authority , and he decided to release him due to the validity of the documents and his lack of ownership of what had come in the investigations of the administrative control .
sorour 's defense had requested a week ago the postponement of the investigations and the presentation of all documents , which prove the reality of his financial situation , and the validity of the financial disclosure , in order to present some documents and papers related to the case .
dr . sorour , the former parliament speaker , had come to the illicit profiteering authority inside an armored deportation car amid security guardianship estimated at 50 officers and soldiers ,
and during sorour 's getting out of the deportation car , his supporters wrapped him in egypt 's flag , out of fear of his being photographed while he was in the provisionary clothes .
sorour 's defense , who is dr . abdel raoud al-mahdi , presented the necessary documents which proved the validity of his client 's situation
and that the reports of the investigations of the administrative control authority , and the public funds investigation are incorrect , concerning his ownership of a large number of villas , real estate , and lands .
it is noteworthy that the authority had attributed to sorour his achievement of a fortune in a manner which exceeds his licit income from his work , taking advantage in that of his political capacity , as the investigations and the reports of the regulatory authorities and the public funds investigation about his wealth indicated that he owns large numbers of villas , chalets , lands , real estate , luxury apartments , financial assets , and others , in a way which violates his licit income sources , in a manner that represents illicit profiteering .
