egypt air is a member at the global star alliance . therefore , it is subject to regular inspection by the european easa and the american fda corporations to ensure the company 's application of the terms of the alliance . among these terms is a term stipulating that employees at the alliance member states make the same salary at every level i . e . the egyptians get the same salary as that of their american counterparts or any other member state in the alliance
