the complainant considered the procedures that followed this to be a major plot where the alternative was created to rule egypt after the death of the president . he proved this by the confusion in domestic politics represented in the issuance of a decision assigning atef ebeid to undertake the functions of the presidency till the president ( the alternate ) returned from his treatment abroad which he considered ( a plastic surgery ) .
in addition to what he called the confusion of the people 's assembly and shura council on ending the parliamentary session . because the procedures for ending the legislative session were not depicted .
and what followed this such as assigning ahmed nazif to form the new government one day after the return of the president ( the alternate ) from the alleged treatment abroad without the resignation of atef ebeid who assumed the functions of the president of the republic to the president - cairo according to what has been noted by reuters news agency at that time .
dr . hamed mekki continued that the egyptian television asserted that president hosni mubarak assigned ahmed nazif the minister of communications and information on friday evening to form the new government although atef ebeid had convened a meeting with the ministers of his government earlier on the same day .
- hamed added that mubarak was not in egypt for a period of 17 days starting from 20 june till 7 july 2004 when he returned to cairo at that time without having a big reception awaiting him .
this was the first time that the president dispensed with youssef wali and kamal el-shazly in the formation of the new ministry and osama el-baz and mustafa el-fiki from service at the presidency
also it was the first time - according to him - a resolution was issued assigning functions of the president of the republic to a prime minister only seven days after the formation of his government because the number of functions were about 134 presidential functions .
hamed proved the execution of this plot by the change that took place in conduct and behavior which included his private life and the president 's preferred hobbies when physical training and squash matches ended .
and being used to travel abroad without taking suzan as he used to do before june 2004 and attending celebrations especially for the graduation of military and police colleges alone without the family as was habitual before 2004 .
