in addition to revealing the truth of the bank power of attorney to suzan and closing the bank accounts of president mohamed hosni mubarak after 2004 . also revealing the truth of the forged decisions issued in his name especially resolutions on loans , grants , legislations and appointments .
the complainant demanded the attorney general to hurry to conserve the files and reports of the president of the republic especially those related to his private life , his health , social and financial conditions since taking office till the date of abandonment of office as well as investigate all those whose names appeared in the communique to reveal the truth of the news of the president 's death
