and zakaria azmi , former head of the presidential cabinet , osama el-baz , former advisor to the president of the republic , mustafa el-fiki , the office head of the president of the republic , dr . youssef wali , former vice-chairman of the national democratic party , dr . mohamed awad tag el-din , former minister of health , mr . mounir thabet , suzan saleh thabet known as suzan mubarak , gamal el-din mohammed hosni el-sayed ibrahim mubarak known as gamal mubarak , and his brother alaa , makram mohamed ahmed , ibrahim saada , samir ragab and ibrahim nafie .
