the court ruled to fine el-adly 10 million and 400 thousand pounds as well as to confiscate 4 million and 113 thousand
giza criminal court issued a 12 year imprisonment sentence against major general habib el-adly , former minister of interior , in the case of accusations of profiteering from his job , exploitation of influence , willful damage of public money and acquisition of same . the court also ruled his dismissal from service according to the german press agency .
the court also ruled a fine of 10 million and 400 thousand pounds and confiscation of 4 million and 113 thousand pounds against el-adly . the court refused the civil actions and compelled their plaintiffs to pay expenses according to al-ahram .
the judgment was issued under the chairmanship of mohammed qansuh and in the presence of amr farouk - attorney general of state security prosecution .
at 9 : 50 am sharp the chairman of the court came out of the council chambers and decided to open the session . he confirmed the presence of the criminal by calling him and said : after reviewing articles of money laundry , the proceedings , and the penal code ; the court ruled a punishment of 7 years imprisonment against habib el-adly , dismissal from his job and fines of 4 million and 350 thousand pounds .
and he assigned a similar amount for the first charge brought against him of money laundering , also punishing the accused for a period of 5 years , fining him 6 million pounds and confiscating 4 million and 113 thousand pounds ( seized from him ) on accusations brought against him in the second charge of profiteering and exploitation of influence .
