informed sources asserted that the former president " mohamed hosni mubarak " asked those close to him - when he was in hospital - to address the concerned authorities about his desire to visit the grave of his grandson " mohamed alaa mubarak . "
he died at 13 years of age on 19 may the year before last
and was buried in the thabet family cemetery ( the family of his grandmother suzan thabet ) in heliopolis .
mubarak requested that the anniversary of the death of his elder grandson not pass without visiting his grave .
he demanded securing the visit for him and his family members .
he considers this to be his wish and a human request that doesn 't conflict with his presence and that his family members pending investigation .
