~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ well , why are you doing this ?
when i saw khaled 's image when he was killed , i entered my office room at home and kept crying for two hours
i felt how much we have become a cowardly people , a people who accept insult and humiliation . . and i decided that i would start by myself and i would change every wrong thing that i used to do . and , therefore , i created the page
i cried on khaled more than i cried on my relatives who had died . .
and whenever i see his image after the torture , depression gets to me , and i say that indeed i will not let any criminal do that and escape punishment .
~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ and who finances you ?
thank god , my sources of funding are many : the first one is my conscience which has roused and woken up . .
this is a source which makes me able to sleep 4 hours a day and wake up in the morning when the first thing that i do , before i wash my face , is that i look at the page
who are you , uncle admin ?
the second source is my education . thank god , i 'm educated and i was among the firsts in my class . and i utilize what i learned in order to serve my country
the third source is that i have a son , and i was afraid that my son would come out and say , " papa , did you see people get tortured and didn 't do anything ? "
the final source is people 's love for me , whom i never saw and who never saw me and don 't know my name . .
every day , they send me messages of thanks and blessings , and they share designs , slogans , and videos , and they spread the page and they spread khaled 's case everywhere ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~
well , admin , what do you want ?
i created this page in secrecy , not only so that nobody hurts me . . but also because i don 't want anything other than that my country becomes a beautiful country . .
i want people to go back to loving one another
and i want all of us not to be silent about injustice
and i want the one who sees something wrong in the country to fix it . .
and i want one to think a thousand times before slapping someone on his face
