you deprived him of being honored , ordered that his name was not to be mentioned , and you put him in prison , and his honorable military history didn 't intercede for him .
mubarak put his hands over his ears and screamed at the top of his voice . - i told you i don 't want to listen . .
suddenly the lights went on in the room and the two nurses appeared followed by the hospital director running behind them .
they looked scared . the manager rushed and bent over mubarak saying : - what happened sir .
mubarak exhaled strongly and mumbled saying : - there are images moving on that wall , i don 't want to see them doctor . . please .
the doctor turned to the wall and didn 't find anything , then he looked at mubarak and seemed to understand
he then whispered something to the nurse , and she took an injection out of the drawer that she prepared immediately and gave to the doctor who said : - excuse me sir . . i 'll inject you with a tranquilizer so you can sleep .
- i don 't want to see those images again .
president mubarak was sleeping on the bed wearing blue pajamas of natural silk
