wednesday , april 20 , 2011
yesterday and the day before yesterday , the city of abu qurqas in the governorate of al-minya witnessed extreme sectarian tension as a result of actions of a coptic personality known for his ties with leaders from overseas who have commitment incitement against the egyptian revolution and have tried to ignite any sectarian fire that would embarrass the institution of the military and raise tensions in the country .
the new sectarian fire broke out due to an initially extremely trivial initial , namely , the presence of a very bad and provocative speed bump created by lawyer alaa rushdi , a member of the national party and a close associate of michael mounir and inflammatory overseas coptic leaderships . he had it put in front of his villa in abu qurqas al-balad , in the governorate of al-minya
some workers at his villas who were armed with automatic weapons attacked shehata talaat asheeri , owner of a microbus vehicle and some passengers who objected to the massive bump , which had caused significant damage to their car
these thugs not only did this , but they also smashed the car and caused significant injuries to a woman and a child passenger . as a result , the driver filed a report at the police department and was detained at the hospital .
after the news spread , a number of muslim citizens who were enraged by the repeated behavior of the christian lawyer alaa rushdi gathered together in al-waadh wal-irshad mosque in abu qurqas . the minya security director and a representative of the military governor came learn about the situation
after calming the attendees and promising to arrest the accused lawyer and those who were involved in the accident , the attendees emerged chanting " god akbar god akbar . " all of a sudden , a hail of bullets was fired from the roofs of some christian houses surrounding the mosque . this resulted in the death of two muslims : ali abdul-qadir ali and maabad abu zeid maabad , from abu qurqas al-balad
the two were walking on the street at the time , which was observed and witnessed by the security directorate and the representative of the military governor . as a result , furious muslim citizens smashed a cafeteria owned by alaa reda rushdi and some nearby stores
