nasr city court of misdemeanor , presided by counsellor fatthallah eisa , secretary wessam abdel fattah , ruled on the libel suit filed by broadcaster reda al-kerdawy against her ex-husband tawfik okasha , " president of al-faraaein channel " to punish him with one year in prison with hard labor , a bail of two thousand pounds , a fine of 10 thousand pounds and temporary compensation 5001 pounds
