it was proved to the court beyond doubt that the defendant committed libel against his ex-wife after the court transcribed the compacted documents by the competent person at the radio and television union .
it became known that he had said on air statements that would harm the reputation of others and that would be publicly indecent to honor
of these statements " it is easy to wake up in the morning and find that you have a fever , but it is not possible to wake up and find that you have a son " .
reda el-sayed ibrahim , also known as reda al-kerdawi , a broadcaster at the egyptian radio and television union , had submitted a request to settle a family dispute before the family court , in which she asked her ex-husband for breastfeeding wages and treatment expenses for their child who has been suffering a disability since birth
the claim was published in one of the national newspapers ,
which led the defendant to deny the news on air through " egypt today " program
which led the defendant to deny the news on air through " misr al-yom " program
which is broadcast on al-faraeein channel , and he refused to pay the treatment expenses for his son , denying the disabled child 's lineage , and making fun of him on air ,
