a group of activists released calls on facebook to cancel immunity for the members of the next people 's assembly after holding the elections .
it was opened under the title " so we know how to hold them accountable , cancel the immunity for the members of the next people 's assembly . " the members defined the previous immunity as " thieving , robbery , corruption , treatment decisions , and loud-mouthed behavior for cause and without cause " .
it was opened under the title " so we know how to hold them accountable , cancel the immunity for the members of the next people 's assembly . " the members defined the previous immunity as " thieving , robbery , corruption , treatment decisions , and loud-mouthed behavior on the empty and the full " .
and they announced their agreement to the suggestion to cancel immunity as a result of the abuse of the members of the people 's assembly in manipulating the egyptian people and infringing upon their rights by hiding in the cloak of immunity .
they said that among the specifics of their call to cancel the immunity is to make it possible to easily hold members of the assembly accountable , and to punish them through the competent agencies in clear legal means as normal citizens who fall under the authority of the law .
the members of the page demanded the necessity of spreading this call before holding the next people 's assembly elections so that the final decision in its regard is made based on the wish of the people .
