around 300 people demonstrated today , thursday , in front of the radio and television building " maspero " between supporting and opposing the investigation with former president hosni mubarak .
the demonstrators who reject the investigation with mubarak raised banners condemning the decision to imprison him for 15 days pending investigations ,
they raised photos and slogans supporting him , and used the sidewalk of the corniche opposite the building as a site for their demonstration .
on the other side of the main gate of the radio and television building , those opposing the former president , his policy over thirty years and all symbols of the former regime gathered , chanting slogans condemning the national party policy prior to the january 25 revolution .
the armed forces in cooperation with the police rushed to separate the demonstrations to prevent clashes between the two side and to facilitate traffic so that there would be no traffic jams in the area ,
while these demonstrations resulted in a partial traffic jam in the streets leading to maspero .
