contrary to popular logic , people have known the character of the new egyptian prime minister ahmed shafik in television drama years before knowing him in political life .
but how did this happen ? ?
do you remember the series raafat el-haggan , his younger sister sherifa and her officer husband , mohamed rafik , and that tense relationship between the two men , as rafik hated raafat el-haggan and regarded him as a conman who couldn 't be trusted .
raafat el-haggan is the artistic name of the egyptian spy refaat el-gammal , as for sherifa el-haggan , it is the artistic name for nazeeha el-gammal , the sister of refaat el-gammal , and major mohamed rafik who appeared in the series is but the artistic name of first lieutenant ahmed shafik , who promoted in his work till he became minister of civil aviation and then prime minister these days .
the esteemed actress afaf shoeib played the role of sherifa , and actor sabri abdel moneim played the role of major rafik with all honesty and skill , and their characters have remained in the minds of the people to this day , although a quarter of a century had passed since that series played , and despite the many characters that appeared in the first and second parts of the well known arabic series " raafat el-haggan " .
the strange thing is that refaat el-gammal wrote in his will to distribute sums of money on the family of general ahmed shafik , which indicates the close relationship he had with his sister and her children , as he had allocated a sum for her from his estate as well as additional sums to her children .
