the fifth incident : prison food for them for 12 continuous years did not change : rice with worms , lava beans with weevils , and lentils with rocks , and the food is served without plates , meaning that the bread has the lentils , lava beans , or rice on top , and the food is put on the floor . and when the cell is opened , all must put their faces to the wall and they are beaten , then the food is placed and whoever moves , the food is poured over his head
the sixth incident : the door is not opened to them except for a half hour per day , and there is no toilet in the cell . defecating is in a bucket , and you are allowed two bottles per day . each bottle is one liter of water to drink from ; no washing and no light . . this resulted in them suffering from severe cases of mange , leprosy , and tuberculosis , and bedbugs , lice , and fleas spread because there was no sunlight entering to them , to the extent that they could not sleep because of them
the seventh incident : during the beatings parties . wounded would fall , and the criminal prison doctors would leave them to die . one of them had a part of a bamboo stick planted under his skin , and it caused him a large boil , so he would press it against the wall so that pus filling half a bucket would come out . he was left until he died after several days and he could not find anybody to give him antibiotics . once again , the incidents with dates , names , and place
the eighth incident : belongs to two of the islamist detainees who died after they held a food strike after they were sexually assaulted . . when they demanded that those who did this atrocious act to them should be punished
the ninth incident : belongs to a detainee whose name is magdy , who swears to god that he was barred from visits for 12 continuous years . he left his son aged 4 months and did not get to know him at the visits for 12 years , four of which he spent in the wadi al-gadid prison , of which he tells his story about the cell with no ventilation at all except for an opening above the door on the corridor , and the temperature all day is no less than 45 degrees . indeed , it increased , so they were afflicted with abscesses , rashes , and poor morale that affected many of them , and insanity afflicted some
the tenth incident : and more than one detainee swears to this , that one of the officers whose names i have mentioned above would make them prostrate themselves at the entrance to the prison block before a photograph of mubarak , and whoever refused would be severely beaten . . indeed , in one of the prisons , the officer would say to them " you sons of ( . . ) , there is nothing called god is greater . . there are the nom de guerres of the officers : ashraf is greater . . ayman is greater . . ramy is greater . . this is other than insulting them with the most foul of words and calling them by women 's names
the eleventh incident : so that i do not forget it . it concerns the goalkeepers ' coach at the el zamalek club , ahmed soliman , who is , at the same time , the investigations officer at the leman tora prison in the nineties , and many of the victims told criminal stories about him that reveal a sadist , criminal personality , and one of them showed us injuries on his face and back resulting from the torture of this criminal , who is a shame to all of egyptian sports
