the third incident : the criminal officers whose names follow : walid farouk el nady - tarek elias - alaa taha - mohamed fawzy - ayman taher - basel hassan - committed the following : stripping the detainees of their clothes entirely and beating them daily with severe brutality . among them are ones who killed dozens under the oppression of frightful torture
the fourth incident : the criminal state security officers at the high-security el aqrab prison , wadi al-gadid , and leman tora prevented , by issuing instructions not to put salt at all in the prisoners ' food because this , in time , exhausts them and causes disfigurement , which is what happened . their teeth fell out and the bones of many became bandy , and they were afflicted with many diseases due to their lack of immunity , and the criminal doctors at the prison did not treat them
