investigations are being conducted with suzanne sabet , wife of the former egyptian president hosni mubarak , in the supreme sovereign headquarters .
the investigation deals with accusations related to financial corruption related to the library of alexandria which has recently been attributed to her , and she is also being interrogated about issues related to the reading for all festival .
according to al-ahram , investigations are being carried out regarding gold coins that are assumed to have been delivered to her by anas el-feki , former minister of information .
dr . hatem al-gabali , the former health minister , will soon be summoned for interrogation on several charges , including the issue of treatment decisions at state expense ,
also , farouk hosni , the former culture minister , and youssef boutros ghali , the former minister of finance , will be summoned on charges of commission of administrative and financial corruption during their tenure
