the coalition of the youth of the revolution has issued a statement regarding the mubarak 's trial and the revolution 's demands , and this is the text of the statement :
the revolutionary youth coalition declared in a press conference a little while ago that the demonstration next friday , on 4 - 15 - 2011 , has been suspended
the coalition said that an opportunity should be given to fulfill other demands including
1 - dismissing governors and university presidents .
2 - dissolving local councils .
3 - dissolving all formations of the national party and returning its headquarters to the public and preventing any attempts to circumvent the demand to dissolve it .
4 - withdrawing the nomination of dr . motafa el feki to the post of general secretary of the league of arab states .
