04 / 13 / 2011
alaa and gamal mubarak , sons of the former president hosni mubarak , arrived at tora farm prison today wednesday morning with shackles on their hands " handcuffed " , and they complied with prison instructions .
subsequently , prison administration took the civilian clothes , mobile phones , and wallets belonging to alaa and gamal mubarak ,
and they were given items for their preventive custody , including 4 blankets , two mattresses , and 4 white pajamas .
the sons of the former president evidence signs of extreme surprise and annoyance as soon as they got out of the deportation vehicle
especially after some who were present repeated things like " god bides his time but does not ignore " ; " an oppressive state lasts for one hour and a just state lasts until the judgement day " ; and " god gives glory to whoever he wills and humiliation to whoever he wills "
especially after some who were present repeated things like " god bides his time but does not ignore " ; " an oppressive state lasts for one hour and a just state lasts until the day of the hour " ; and " god gives glory to whoever he wills and humiliation to whoever he wills "
also - alaa and gamal - declined the preventive custody prisoners ' breakfast and demanded mineral water bottles from the prison cafeteria .
counselor abdel meguid mahmoud had ordered imprisonment of former president hosni mubarak and his two sons for 15 days while they are being questioned on accusations of incitement to attack demonstrators during the 25 th of january revolution .
