safwat el sherif has been added to the list of former officials imprisoned pending investigation for corruption . .
counselor asem al gohary , head of the illicit gains authority , ordered the imprisonment of el sherif for 15 days pending investigation .
in a heated session that continued for more than 12 hours , the illicit gains authority confronted safwat el sherif , president of the shura council and general secretary of the former national party , with the charges , evidence , and investigations concerning the illegal inflation of wealth belonging to him and his family .
el sherif said that he mentioned the sources of his income in his financial disclosure report and that any gifts he received were nominal , not costly .
safwat el sherif arrived at the illicit gains authority at 10 am today in a black mercedes and escorted by two of his private guards , his son ashraf , and two grandchildren , ahmad and ibrahim .
afterward , his lawyer jameel saeed and another lawyer arrived .
the interrogation of el sherif started at 10 : 20 .
he was also confronted by chancellor ahmad tulba , head of the investigation at the administrative control authority and the public funds investigation department , and confirmed that he and his wife manal atiyah and his children eman , ashraf , ehab and their wives own more than 20 palaces , villas , and apartments in cairo , al-tagammu al-khamis , marina , and lisan al-wuzaraa in abu sultan , and that his two grandchildren own 8 villas and apartments .
