the minister of affairs of the people 's assembly and the shura council and local development minister , councilor , mohammad attia , has announced that the presidency elections " president of the republic " will take place late next may , , and he has granted a time limit of 3 weeks for the submission of the nominees ' papers starting march 10
and it is the scheduled time to open the door for nomination , , and a month and a half " 45 days " for electoral promotion , and presentation of the program of every nominee to the public " the people "
he has also added that the supreme electoral commission is responsible for specifying the presidency election date in egypt , , and he also pointed that any modification to the presidential elections law includes the announcement of its results in every public committee in the governorates in order to achieve transparency and credibility
and the advisory council , headed by mansour hassan , has discussed yesterday evening the time schedules to be followed after opening the door for submitting the nomination papers for the presidency of the republic ]
on the other hand , the spokesman for the advisory council , mohamed el-khouly , has stated that the meeting discussed the necessity to speed up selecting the constituent assembly charged with drafting the constitution in parallel with the presidential elections , , and drawing a new constitution before a new president undertakes the presidency of the republic
and on a different level , the general guide of the muslim brotherhood , dr . mohammed badie , has stated after casting his vote in the shura elections yesterday in bani sweif , that the muslim brotherhood should not be the dominant political shield and that the coming president should be neutral and should be consensual among all sides , and he added that egypt has many qualifies persons and figures who can shoulder the responsibility
and amr moussa , the potential nominee for the presidency of the republic has clarified during his tour in al-fayoum governorate yesterday that the mission of the coming president with the government , the parliament , and the rest of the state institutions is represented in the rebuilding of egypt , and responding to the demands of the revolution , and he warned of not transferring power to an elected president and of obstructing the path of the democratic change .
