the supreme council of armed forces agreed , following the meeting between lieutenant general sami anan the chief of staff of the armed forces and deputy chairman of the supreme council of armed forces with messrs , the heads of political parties , which reached thirteen parties , and were invited at twelve noon on saturday to discuss all requests by political powers
that they were requesting yesterday at the recovery of the revolution friday in various governorates in the republic
the most important of which was to amend the elections law regarding the individual system and the ability of parties to participate in the circles through the individual system
as well as ceasing to apply the emergency law which was announced
the supreme council of armed forces today agreed to annul article five of the elections law for the people 's assembly and the shura ( consultative ) council , which limited the nomination of independents in the individual system
it is also studying the announcement of the final termination date of the emergency law within hours
dr . emad abdel ghafour , president of el-nour salafi party also stated that the supreme council of armed forces will make a statement within 72 hours to abolish the emergency law on october 12 , which is the date to open the door for nominations to the people 's assembly elections .
