this is for :
1 - the immediate cessation of all military trials of civilians .
2 - the setting of a timetable for the military council to hand over management of the country 's affairs to an elected civilian authority after the promised six months have expired .
3 - abolition of the oppressive law that prohibits strikes and sit-ins .
4 - the full amendment of the election law .
since the current law results in fraudulent parliaments
