" march plan "
the friday of heeding the call 13 / 5 / 2011
the activities of the friday of heeding the call aim to launch million man marches in the various countries of the world to support palestine and in support of its cause .
proposed program :
the palestinians in the west bank launch mass marches in the main cities after the friday prayer .
the palestinians in the gaza strip launch mass marches in the main cities after the friday prayer .
the palestinians in jerusalem and the ' 48 lands congregate at the al-aqsa mosque after the friday prayer .
the palestinians and the free in egypt congregate in tahrir square after the friday prayer .
the palestinians and the free in the countries of the levant launch mass marches in the main cities and camps after the friday prayer .
the palestinians and the free in the arab states launch marches in the capitals after the friday prayer .
