the palestinians and the free in europe launch marches in the capitals after the friday prayer .
the palestinians and the free in turkey launch a mass march in istanbul after the friday prayer .
the palestinians and the free in america launch a mass march in washington after the friday prayer .
the palestinians and the free in the rest of the countries of the world launch marches in the capitals after the friday prayer .
note : only the palestinian flag is to be raised and the israeli flag is to be burned .
saturday of the roaring , 14 / 5 / 2011
the congregations of the saturday of the roaring aim to make the western world , particularly america , hear the loudest voice of the arabs , the muslims , and the free of the world who are angry at the continuing occupation of palestine and the displacement of millions of refugees .
