the problem started when the young man continued to stare at the wife who was wearing revealing clothes with the excuse that it was fashionable
as was usual and typical in modern times . . the husband seemed to love his wife and didn 't find anything wrong with what she was wearing ,
it is a personal freedom . . but due to the constant staring of the young man . . the husband and wife got really angry . .
and the wife flirtatiously leaned over and complained to her husband . .
suddenly , the husband reprimanded the young man and turned to him saying , " why are looking at my wife like that ? don 't you have sisters ? " , ,
i was looking outside of the bus so i only heard it . i don 't follow all of the details of fashion . i wear what my religion allows , what suits my taste , and what compels others to respect me . .
may the peace , mercy , and blessings of god be upon you ! !
then the voices of the passengers rose and , as we know how the egyptian people are , there were those who insulted the young man without knowing what happened . . thinking that he was flirting with the wife . . without making sure of it . .
there were also those who just watched . . and the driver , who said that the young man should be burned in a public square . .
the women participated , this is equality , so they had to participate even though they didn 't know what happened . . and they said , " even after the revolution , there are people who still flirt ? ! ! "
indeed , i was surprised by this strange opinion . . but i was only listening ,
and what drew my attention was that everyone talked and argued except the young man who caused the problem ,
after the situation quieted down , i heard him say with strong self-confidence . . " are you done ! ! i am a sinner . . i am an infidel ! ! i must kill myself for my unforgivable mistake . . since neither she nor her husband made a mistake ! ! "
here the voice of the husband rose , " what have we done ! ! tell us , as you talk so boldly ! ! "
the young man said quietly , " you allowed your wife to go out in revealing clothes that show more than they cover ! ! so i have the right to stare ,
why are you angry ? i only see what she shows , and i and everyone else can share it , and you have all the hidden parts . this was your decision . . when you put your wife on display for everyone ? ! ! "
after , i didn 't hear anything other than the sound of the crying wife . then she said in an inaudible whisper , " i can wear whatever i want . . this is a personal freedom ! ! "
i hope that you are all well . . something happened that really annoyed me . . and i would like to know your opinion about it ! ! and who was wrong ! !
but the husband was overcast with concern and sadness , and i only heard him ask to get off so he could run away from what happened ! !
here in this situation , i would not talk about the clothing of the wife , because there is less modesty ! !
