the story of the elephant and the six blind persons
6 blind persons stood in front of an elephant , and each of them wanted to describe it .
the first one said , holding the tusk , " it is pointy , sharp , smooth , and curved . "
the second one held the knee and said : " no , it is cylindrical , curly , and thick . "
the third one held the tail and said : " it is thin , pliable , and coarse . "
