the minister 's tour after that included " al-zahraa high school " for girls , where he inspected the study system in classes and discovered the absence of some members of the teaching staff
he discussed the academic level with the students ,
he also explained some classes in geometry , " pythagoras theory " for first secondary students ,
he noticed the absence of some teachers from their classes and so he decided to transfer the english language teacher and the arabic language teacher from the school .
the minister issued his recommendations to cancel all office follow-ups , and the need for preparing follow-up schedules in the field by the head of the directorate for all primary , preparatory , secondary and technical education directors of education , provided that they follow-up these schedules and hold the negligent accountable .
on the other hand , the minister of education issued a decision to dismiss dr . yousry afifi , director of the curricula development center ,
and cancel the referral and contracts of 10 officials at the center , and deduct 15 days from their salaries for writing books to a number of publishers
