dr . ahmed zaki badr , the minister of education surprised everyone at el-kholafaa el-rashedeen school for boys in helwan with an inspection tour to find out about part of the education condition in egypt , to reveal obvious shortcomings in the education process at the school , and decides to transfer 98 teachers , administrators and the headmaster of the school following the tour .
according to a report by al-hayat satellite channel , badr was surprised that the headmaster was absent , arriving late to find the minister waiting for him ,
lack of organization in the morning lines ,
absence of supervision on the school schedule system ,
as well as the deteriorated condition of facilities at the school , especially the toilets ,
