sorry moslem , i was late with my story . it has been some days since i 've passed by . pardon me .
the story is that long ago , when i was a 9 year-old girl , it was summer and my mother and father were traveling . they went to offer their condolences in our village in upper egypt .
we sat , my older brothers and i , on the canal till it was late with the neighbors ' children telling stories about demons .
all of a sudden , we heard something making a very loud noise in the canal . there were a lot of sticks bristling when we found something shining in the water with wide eyes looking at us .
most importantly , we all ran ; me , my brothers and the children who were sitting with us . we entered the house . the lights were off that day . we entered and kept behind the door . then , we bought a sofa and placed it behind the door .
we were afraid it might open the door . seriously , by god , shortly afterwards , someone kept knocking at the door and calling us ; even every one of us by his own name . we were holding each other trembling .
the second day my father and mother came from the village . we told them the story . they said you 're imagining things . but actually , while they were sitting alone , i heard them saying : it 's probably the genie inhabiting the canal that appeared to them . nobody talk about her in front of them .
but that day , i went to my brothers to tell them . since then , we haven 't sat by the canal again .
