i 'll tell you how sit-ins are broken up in the united states .
very simply , the job of the police is to arrest the sitter-in charged with hindering a government office or a certain street ,
and violence is never used except to arrest the accused , ,
and , in the event that he is arrested , he is treated in a human and respectful way ,
