mubarak accepted the resignation of ebeid 's government and pays tribute to its performance
with my best regards ,
10 01 : 32
mohamed hosni mubarak
president of the arab republic of egypt
president hosni mubarak had received earlier on friday a letter from dr . atef ebeid in which he submitted his government 's resignation .
the following is the text of the message :
mr . president , mohamed hosni mubarak ,
president of the republic :
i greet you with respect and thank you for kindly providing the opportunity to me and my fellow members of the government to work under your leadership to implement your assignments in order to maintain the renaissance being achieved during this year in all sectors .
mr . president , you have achieved for egypt an unprecedented renaissance in history , and maintained its leadership position in the arab and african worlds . you also defended the national unity and supported security and safety for all citizens , gained continuous support for egypt from the whole world , and defended the legitimate rights of the arab people .
the council held on friday , july 9 , 2004 is honored to submit its resignation to your excellency .
may allah protect you for egypt and grant you health .
prime minister ,
dr . atef mohamed ebeid
- -
