dear dr . atef ebeid ,
greetings !
i received with great appreciation your letter dated july 9 , 2004 , in which you submitted the resignation of the government .
i inform you of my decision to accept this resignation , but i would like to pay tribute to you for your excellent performance as prime minister and for the great efforts made by the government under your leadership in all areas to achieve our goals in developing our country and achieving prosperity and high position for its people .
your government undertook its duties with honesty and integrity under complicated international , regional and internal circumstances . you set a good example for giving and contributed through your clear vision , your sincere work and your informed response to the hopes of the public in achieving the objectives of our ambitious development plans . you also supported us through integrated implementation of our vision of development , modernization and renewal in all areas of national work in order to keep pace with the spirit of our time and overcome the challenges and obstacles for the good of our homeland and our citizens .
in expression of my sincere thanks to you and the members of your government for your efforts , and my appreciation for what you offered to our homeland , i wish you good health and continued success .
