3 . you should try to spend longer periods of time together that are more enjoyable .
a couple who works suffers more in this regard : in that family time decreases and becomes full of other non-domestic concerns , and this is when the role of compromise and understanding , in order to find time for family , comes into play .
4 . marriage is fun !
we have said previously that marriage would 'nt be fun , but there will be many wonderful things you 'll share and laugh about . you may experience difficult circumstances which will make you laugh . just make your life wonderful and try new things .
5 . one of the partners will sacrifice more than the other in order to make the marriage a success .
the sacrifice can be psychological or physical , as the family may simply move to another country where the husband finds a better job . thus , the wife would sacrifice by being away from her family , and may have to leave her work for the benefit of her husband .
giving birth is often another reason for sacrifice , when a woman stops studying or leaves her job to be with her kids .
6 . the spouse may change ! !
sometimes inexplicable things may happen between two spouses which leads one of them to change his ways , and such change isn 't for the better in most cases .
marriage has a lot of surprises . you may have become acquainted with your partner after a love affair or a short time of acquaintance .
7 . there will be many differences .
with age , and changes of life and priorities , each spouse might end up having different goals and many reasons for their differences .
8 . sometimes , life becomes much better !
sometimes the relationship is blessed and , therefore , the spouses feel like they are a single entity , and life becomes better because the goals have not changed and personalities have not changed .
9 . truth always prevails .
whether you are being truthful with each other , the truth always comes out , because lies are fleeting , whether the marriage was based on interests or there was any form of infidelity or any problems which the spouses tried to hide from one other .
may you live long in safety !
o allah , grant us peace in all our homes .
amen , lord of the worlds
but this doesn 't mean you know him well . you are still in unknown territory when it comes to married life , and living in the same house as husband and wife .
1 . marriage doesn 't mean you will not feel lonely .
but marriage doesn 't mean loneliness either .
we often hear about marital problems which occur right after the marriage , mostly resulting from not spending enough time together as a family .
after the honeymoon and after receiving congratulations , and one month after , or less , of being together for long periods of time , each spouse will return to his / her previous activities , whether it is to work or with friends , and the family obligations will be the only shared things between them .
2 . marriage doesn 't mean you will live like a lover every day .
love turns into affability and understanding , and sometimes ( into ) a system of marital duties , and occasionally into many family , financial and even personal problems .
although love is not completely absent , it becomes another kind of love .
