president mubarak dispels the rumors of his illness by visiting the smart village .
president mubarak
president hosni mubarak dispelled the rumors of his illness - which spread widely during the past two days on the internet and text messages - through his field tour of the smart village at north cairo , during which he was briefed on the achievements of the telecommunications and information technology sector .
he also held a meeting at the village , which was attended by prime minister dr . ahmed nazif and a number of ministers and governors , according to al-ittihad newspaper .
the rumors have linked president mubarak 's cessation of any activities during the past few days to his health condition .
informed sources said that president mubarak spent his annual leave at borg el-arab in alexandria , as he is used to doing this every year in august .
prime minister ahmed nazif said that mubarak 's visit to the smart village confirmed his support for the telecommunications and information technology industry .
this is a promising industry that started in egypt during his reign , and under his sponsorship and it has achieved a leap in recent years .
