these advertisements compelled a journalist from the egyptian " rose al-yusuf " magazine to visit the cafe , and there followed the surprises as she said , because the cafe was a branch in an international chain for covered women only .
and inside the prices are touristic , and a hair stylist for covered women . also , every wednesday , covered women fashion and accessories shows are organized with the attendance of the young actress , at prices ranging from 75 to 200 dollars for one cloak , as well as a permanent exhibition for prayer rugs and prayer clothing .
a new coffee house for women was opened named " girls ' cafe " . an egyptian magazine claimed that it forbids the entry of uncovered and christian women , and limits its services to the children of upper classes .
as for entering the cafe , it is only by hitting the bell and obtaining permission
the journalist confirmed that some of the workers in the cafe were subjected to dismissal .
even though hanan did not confirm or deny the information published by " rose al-yusuf " magazine a few days ago , nevertheless many of the egyptian forums witnessed extremely harsh comments and interjections considering these actions to " affect the national fabric , and support claims that apartheid exists between muslims and christians " , especially that it is the first public place in egypt to forbid the entrance of christians .
some came to the point of expecting the emergence of places carrying signs of " no entry for non-muslims " according to what the kuwaiti " al-nahar " magazine reported on tuesday , dec . 18 , 2007 .
some internet forums demanded the organization of protest stands in front of the cafe located in the new egypt neighborhood to the east of cairo . this presented an opportunity for sites hostile to hijab , to emphasize that wearing a head cover is " merely business , whose goal is dominance of the concept of the flock .
a specialized blog published an attack on hijab and niqab , the subject of the cafe .
contrasting remarks followed , the most notable being " hanan started an uproar because it strengthens the idea of class divisions " noting the exaggerated high prices of clothing of covered women recently .
the christian objections led a number of muslims to participate in coptic blogs , to offer consecutive apologies on what happened , describing the cafe as " a rejected , exceptional case " .
but this does not negate the continuing congestion due to " hanan turk 's girls " and the demand for formulating laws to forbid the establishment of any enterprise on a religious basis as long as the enterprise has nothing to do with religions .
according to rose al-yusuf magazine , the wife of the egyptian actor ahmad al-saqa withdrew from her participation in the cafe enterprise after having failed in convincing the covered actress in allowing uncovered women to enter .
