for every summit there is a bottom , and for every bottom there is a summit , except for the arab summit which is the only one of its kind that has a summit with no bottom . that is because most governments and leaders came to power in an illegitimate way , either by rigging elections or by coups , or by inheriting power , a method that is no longer suitable for any people who are aware of their interests and priorities
