a famous incident occurred when the late abd al-rahman azzam , the first president of the league of arab states , offered the idea of forming the league of arab states
he went to king abd al-aziz , the king of saudi arabia , to offer the idea to him . abd al-aziz received him and listened to him , and after he had left , he ridiculed him by saying : pharaohs want to be leaders of arabs
this sentence alone is sufficient for us to know that the basis on which the structure of the league of arab state was built was a weak foundation that was neither supported nor rectified by anything as long as that racial and tribal perspective controls the minds of the leaders of arab states
