and it was the agreement that aroused wide controversy in egypt after it was entered into as of last year .
it was considered a mandatory action prescribed by the constitution , an essential requirement to undertake work , and a kind of control practiced by the legislative authority - according to the text of the constitution - on some of the administration 's work . therefore , it was the most suitable system to monitor the work of the administration concerning ( granting concessions for exploiting resources of the natural wealth the people have been gifted with ) ,
