the lie of article 76
so , i said to her , " since you are an expert in politics { of course , her political expertise is no greater than the expertise of my grandmother - may god have mercy upon her - on nuclear fuel } what have you gathered from the subject of changing the constitution ? "
she said to me , " what i have understood and gathered is that the president seems to have become tired of ruling and has decided to quit , and he will be followed by whoever is chosen by the people .
this on the one hand , and on the other hand , that he eliminated the rumors of heritability that filled the world . so now , in light of the new change , no name will be imposed on us , nor will we be told , " this is the president . "
i answered her with a new fit of laughter until her face reddened from anger and she tried to leave me , but i took a hold of her and said to her , " i will explain to you why i am laughing ? "
i said to her , " your answer to my question confirms that they have succeeded in their effort to mislead the naive people of our nation who understand politics like najah al-mouji understood the reconciliation policy ( lucky is he who brings two people together in marriage ) . "
i said to her , " your answer to my question confirms that they have succeeded in their effort to mislead the naive people of our nation who understand politics like najah al-mouji understood the reconciliation policy ( lucky is he who gets two heads in lawfulness ) . "
anger mixed with the lack of understanding on her face and she went on saying .
" oh mother of marwan , the new change opened a big door for discussion between the advocates of the decision and its opponents ,
and the whole discussion revolves around whether this could happen , or whether it would never happen ?
will the day come when the president of the state is elected and does not descend upon us by parachute like those who preceded him ?
but they overlooked a very important point . "
when i heard for the first time from the mouth of the dearest leader and compassionate heart about changing article 76 of the constitution so that electing the president of the state would be through direct vote and not by referendum .
she said , " what is this point father of knowledge , you jean-jacques rousseau of your time ? "
