an iranian official threatens the egyptian regime and insults president mubarak
in spite of this , the european union removed their from the lists of what it considers terrorist groups .
in a new escalation of the iranian attack on the egyptian regime , ismail kawthari , a member of the national security committee in the islamic shura council , attacked the egyptian president hosni mubarak , depicting him as an agent of israel . these declarations could raise more tension among the two countries , against the background of the exchange of insults between them , which continued throughout the period of the israeli attack on gaza .
the iranian fars news agency quoted kawthari today warning the egyptian government not to support the mujahedin al-khalq , which opposes the iranian regime , and which iranian officials describe as a group of terrorist hypocrites , on its land .
kawthari formed , in an exclusive interview with the fars news agency , his attack on the egyptian president , emphasizing that the moving of the headquarters of the mujahedin al-khalq group to work from cairo is not inconceivable .
a member of the national security committee in the shura council said in addition that , " egyptian authorities need to recognize the mistake of their previous decisions towards hezbollah and the hamas movement , and their obstinacy toward the islamic republic of iran , which , kawthari stressed , would make decisive decisions in this regard . "
the deputy of the iranian shura council said , " the egyptian people will have a reaction toward this in case the egyptian regime should commit any new mistakes . "
kawthari pointed to the harm sustained by the two nations of iran and iraq because of the mujahedin al-khalq group , which kawthari depicted as terrorists , saying , " the movement of these terrorists to egypt will harm egyptian citizens . since the egyptian people do not approve of this presence , there will be reactions from these people . "
the countries of the european union declared , at the beginning of this month , the removal of the name of the iranian mujahedin al-khalq group , which takes refuge in the iranian-iraqi borders , from the lists of organizations that are classified by the union as terrorist groups along with the hamas movement , the taliban , the lebanese hezbollah , and the abu sayyaf group .
the last attack by the iranian deputy on egypt comes in the aftermath of angry egyptian , arab , and international responses to the declaration of an iranian official concerning iran 's right to impose sovereignty on bahrain and the emirates .
