negotiations are now being made between the israeli side and the palestinian side , purporting that the crossings will be opened provided that prisoner solider gilad shalit is released .
gilad is pronounced gilad shalit or qilat shalit ( in hebrew : ( ) , with an egyptian g , ( august 28 , 1986 ) . he is an israeli soldier working in the israeli army . he was captured and transferred from israel to the gaza strip at the hands of the ezzedeen al-qassam brigades of the hamas movement on june 25 , 2006 , after he had sustained injuries following an attack made by the ezzedeen al-qassam brigades on an israeli force from the armored corps , which was stationed near the border with the gaza strip to monitor it .
gilad shalit was born in the city of nahariya on august 28 , 1986 . then he moved with his family to the town of " mitzpe hila " in the western galilee . he was the second of three children of noam and aviva shalit .
in july 2005 he enlisted in the army ( as required by israeli law ) and he served in the armored corps .
the attack resulted in the killing of two israeli soldiers and the wounding of 5 others . members of the ezzedeen al-qassam arrested gilad shalit , who was among the wounded , and locked him in a tank . they transported him to gaza strip where he is still under captivity .
the israeli army responded to the attack with an intensive ground operation inside the strip for the first time since it withdrew in september 2005 , but they were not able to find ghilad shalit .
although the whereabouts of gilad shalit are still unknown , there is no doubt that he is still alive , because the ezzedeen al-qassam brigades sent a tape recording of his voice on the occasion of the passing of one year after his arrest [ 1 ] [ 2 ] . in the recording , gilad shalit says that his health is deteriorating .
