imagine , my dear reader , that an arab summit was held in doha at the same time a preparatory meeting was held for another arab summit in kuwait . . even the arab citizens who were content with just watching were bewildered regarding which of the two summits they should follow directly on tv . . at the same time the general secretary of the arab league was delivering a speech in kuwait , the foreign minister of qatar was delivering a statement at the doha summit .
