el fiki had been closely associated with mubarak and his son gamal
the official egyptian television network , under the instructions of el fiki and el sheikh , had launched a campaign against the organizers of the demonstrations that began on last 25 january and continued for 18 days , forcing mubarak to step down after staying in power for 30 years .
