for the first time in 30 years , studies began at egyptian universities today , saturday , without the presence of state security members and university guards who are part of the interior . studies began in cairo , ain shams , assuit , zagazig , menoufia , south valley , beni suef , banha , and the damietta branch of mansoura university . some of these universities saw demonstrations on the first few days of studies , while they were halted in the rest of universities .
the university guards evacuated all of their posts last wednesday and thursday and the universities ' administrative security units have assumed their duties , and every university still tries to complete its administrative structure .
studies began at cairo university in the colleges of law , arts , and business , while at ain shams university they have begun in the colleges of dentistry and science .
members of civil security , who replaced the university guards at cairo university , wear light blue shirts , blue neckties , and blue jackets . the university intends to provide them with training programs and courses before they assume the work tasks .
general moutaz abu shady , the university secretary , said that the administrative security body will consist of 900 people who will perform the same principle tasks as the guards , namely to protect individuals , institutions , and storage facilities , emphasizing that members from " the interior " will never be used .
abu shady indicated that the university will employ some women as security supervisors , whose mission is to inspect the women , in addition to cameras that will be used to monitor the perimeter of the university in order to provide complete protection to the institutions of university .
he added that it has been arranged with the interior ministry to secure the exits of the university , the reception at kasr el aini , and the dental clinic at the university , in addition to placing units from the " interior " outside the university campus .
today , cairo university witnessed two demonstrations where hundreds of students from the university 's dentistry college demanded the dismissal of the dean , while tens of teaching fellows and members of the support body at the college of darul uloom demonstrated to demand the removal of the dean of the college .
