25 minutes was sufficient for the army to control the building completely from inside after it entered into chases with state security officers , who tried to escape through the tunnels , but the army arrested them ,
while others attempted to escape over the rear fences of the building and found the armed forces waiting for them
tens of officers and petty officers of state security were arrested and placed in vehicles belonging to the armed forces to transport them to army camps to await questioning , in addition to seizing a number of important documents that were not burned .
in addition to reports about the salafists and the mosques they frequent , and ledgers segmenting the forces into groups and symbols and the salaries of the employees in the building , but what was notable in the matter is that most of these documents bore the signature of habib al-adly , the former interior minister .
the building fell within 25 minutes in the hands of the army . . and the officers tried to escape . . and the armed forces seized documents with the signature of al-adly that include information on the brotherhood and the salafists
the fortified state security building in october did not stay except for minutes until it fell in the hands of the men of the armed forces , upon which all documents were seized before they could be destroyed and the officers of the service were arrested after pursuit in the tunnels of the building once and their attempt to escape over the rear fence another .
many backstage and strange scenes that were witnessed by the building hours before the arrival of the army were recounted by the petty officers of state security investigations who escaped from the building ,
one of them confirmed that , at the time when " habib ibrahim al-adly , " the former interior minister , was on trial at the giza criminal court in the fifth settlement , orders were issued by officials at state security headquarters october to burn all the important documents and papers that the building contains ,
so they were collected in " cartons " and thrown in a garbage " dump " at a distance of meters from the building fence , and they set fire to most of them .
and he added that smoke began to rise and tongues of flame rose until they passed the building itself , which caught the attention of the passersby on the 26 july corridor near the building , and tens gathered in front of the building and attempted to break into it , but their attempts failed .
the voices of the demonstrators rose in front of the building after they became sure that state security officials had come close to destroying all of the important documents that contain sovereign secrets pertaining to the state ,
and chanted a number of slogans including " the people want to try state security " and " burning the documents will not make us forget the past " and continued to chant until the arrival of the army .
the army imposed a security cordon around the building and succeeded in storming it , while the ululations of the women were uninterrupted in front of the building out of happiness with the armed forces , and the men repeated " the people and the army are one hand . "
