hundreds of internet activists adopted a call for the cancelation ramadan tv shows and allocating their budgets , which reached half a billion pounds , for the welfare of the families of the martyrs and the injured of the january 25 revolution .
activists said , in the context of their appeal , that it is time to end the phenomenon of having incredible and excessive amounts of money , which reach millions of pounds , paid to actors in order to play a hero on tv shows during the month of ramadan ,
because the attitude of " take the money and run " has become unacceptable to all egyptians from all walks of life , including the arts .
they called upon the illicit gains authority to investigate the source of the massive wealth of many actors and producers , who don 't hesitate to spend millions on producing immoral drama works that corrupt the minds and public taste of the egyptian people .
in the same context , many internet visitors emphasized , in response to the appeal , that the next month of ramadan will undoubtedly be different and distinct from previous years because it will witness large-scale political activity as presidential elections will be held next september .
they explained that the month of ramadan will be in the month of august , which means that there won 't be time to watch drama shows because people 's time - according to them - will be distributed during the holy month between worship and politics . they repeated the slogan " no tv shows , let the people see a better future "
