the gist of the news .
the year 2010 refused to say goodbye without presenting us with another new craze that has attracted some egyptian youths , with some making fun of it and others welcoming it .
the idea is based around a youth camp , but not a sports camp or an entertainment camp or even a scout camp . . the camp is for people " who want to get married " and end with " graduation " .
in an unprecedented step , the " one heart " foundation announced it would organize a camp to train young people wanting to marry under the slogan " come on families . . come on stability " , within the proceedings of the " family justice " project in coordination with the ministry of family and population .
doctor fairuz omar , the chairperson of the board of the foundation said that the project is aimed at training 300 young men and women in an attempt to teach them the skills of choosing the right life partner and leading a healthy relationship between the two partners in order to create a successful family enjoying a happy and stable married life .
doctor fairuz omar , the chairperson of the board of the foundation said that the project is aimed at training 300 young men and women in an attempt to make them acquire the skills of choosing the right life partner and leading a healthy relationship between the two partners in order to create a successful family enjoying a happy and stable married life .
the foundation performs non-profit community work .
