many things concern us about our social life in our times and perhaps most prominent is the technological electronic means , the internet ,
the internet is a means of communication and its employment depends on the person who uses it . .
but studies have shown that it is possible that use of the internet has effects on social relations , as dr . ibrahim othman , professor of sociology at the university of jordan , said . he added to the jordanian news agency that the first of these effects appeared in children under the age of ten . .
it was discovered that it can lead to the possibility of social isolation of the child and to his lack of interaction with the rest of the family or peers , thus taking away the conditions for building the skills needed to interact with others . apart from the fact that the internet has opened an area of * * communication that did not exist for young people in the past , particularly what is called " chatting . "
he explained that this has led to building relationships with people from outside the local community and the nation and in some cases has led to the possibility of finding a job or even marriage . this is the opinion of the youth ,
however , in general , the internet has become a basic source for information and reference sources , apart from its use in shaping the attitudes and values of individuals , thus giving the countries that have it the possibility of imposing their culture on the members of other communities ,
dr . osman concluded by saying that the presence of the internet may have caused the traditional units that were responsible for the upbringing of human beings to lose many of their functions and importance ,
