in summary , they spoke with him about the system used in their workplace
and he told me that the preference there is for those who work hard , and that the right to incentives and promotions is not based on age or seniority in the workplace ; rather they are for whomever carries out his job in the best manner-and that 's why everyone perfects his work . .
this , in turn , reflects on the society as a whole , and it is a main reason for the advancement of these countries
there is no nepotism or preference for landowners over foreigners ; rather there is one standard only for assessing , which is being skilled at the job . .
the prophet , peace and blessings be upon him , said . . { { god loves that when any one of you does a job , he does it perfectly } }
