let 's join the meat-boycott campaign
aswan governor mostafa al-sayed took the same approach when he called on egyptian families monday to adopt a campaign to boycott the meat that is available for sale at butcher shops for a period of one month and substitute it with the meat that is available at consumer associations in order to combat the rising prices .
the governorate of aswan 's people 's assembly decided last week to fix the price of meat at 34 pounds per kilo .
along with issuing penalties to violators ,
along with signing penalties to violators ,
restaurants and tourism establishments are boycotting meat on monday , april 26
comment on the subject , send to a friend , print the page
written by : ismat saad
the board of directors of the chamber of tourism establishments announced that it will require all egyptian restaurants and tourism establishments to boycott meat this april 26 , with penalties issued against the establishments that fail to carry out ( the boycott ) .
during a telephone conversation on tuesday with egypt television 's program " egypt today , " wagdy el kerdany , president of the chamber of tourism establishments , stated that restaurants and tourism establishments will not provide any meals that contain meat on that day .
he also said that this step comes in solidarity with citizens facing the excessive rise in meat prices .
he confirmed that this decision is binding on all restaurants , tourism establishments , and entertainment theaters in solidarity with the campaign to boycott the unjustified and unconvincing meat as a mandatory experiment that will be repeated again if these increases continue .
it 's worth mentioning that minister of agriculture amin abatha previously called on citizens to boycott meat as a means of exerting pressure on merchants to lower their prices , after they reached record highs .
