and we should not neglect the emotional perspective that the trip enriches in many ways . .
if you are a bus harassment division professional , you 're a happy-go- lucky guy , while if you are more romantic , you could be witness to a love story that may culminate in marriage . and if your trip is a little longer , you may witness the birth of the married couple 's first child , and it 's very possible they will name him after you ( because you had a life together ) . .
as for the health perspective , one of the first prescriptions for the passengers is to boil guava leaves and wrap your chest with newspapers . . in order to fulfill the ministry 's wise plan to make you get used to inhaling the mixture of exhaust fumes that will make you immune to any chemical wars that might be launched against the country in the distant future . .
as for the religious perspective , the bus trip will make it stronger by you finishing the whole qur 'an on the way ( reading , memorizing , and reciting ) , or you paying your alms tax to the beggars , or you contemplating god 's wisdom that made the wealthy people build themselves airport tunnels while you 're above the ground coughing dirt . .
as for the religious perspective , the bus trip will make it stronger by you finishing the whole qur 'an on the way ( reading , memorizing , and reciting ) , or you paying your zakat to the beggars , or you contemplating god 's wisdom that made the wealthy people build themselves airport tunnels while you 're above the ground coughing dirt . .
