without exception , one trip on a government bus is able to enrich all aspects of your life . .
from the nutritional perspective , the sausage and liver carts that are present in the station , along with the chocolate and gum vendors inside the buses , provide you with a complete meal containing all the nutritional elements at prices that everyone can afford . .
from the educational perspective , the length of the trip may tempt you to bring a book or a newspaper , or you may get inspired to write a poem , a short story , or a 3 -volume epic novel that may turn into a cinematic film that 's written , acted in , and shown , while you still did not reach your station .
