after the disasters that we 've read about , along with the horrible train accidents , i was surprised by this strange piece of news : subway locomotive without a driver destroys 4 cars in misr al-jadida
to continue the episodes of gross negligence , a service locomotive belonging to misr al-jadida 's subway facility took off for a distance of more than ten kilometers without a driver yesterday , seriously injuring one person who was driving his car and causing damage to three other cars in different locations before colliding with a subway train inside al-matriya garage and finally stopping .
engineer salah faraj , head of the public transport authority , said : " the stray locomotive is used to transport equipment and repair and maintenance supplies belonging to misr al-jadida 's subway , and is known as the ' surface train . '
the driver neglected to take the necessary precautions to operate it , so it started by itself until it was stopped by the collision in al-matriya garage . "
immediately upon hearing about the accident , cairo mayor dr . abdel azim wazier decided to refer the officials at misr al-jadida 's subway administration department for questioning .
